<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Mru</book>
  <para style="h">Josua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Josua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Josua</para>
  <para style="mt1">Josua</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Josua chekhai, now arui khin dow 1,400-1,350 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Israeluüa vüi hai pur prakowi kowh maru vüi Josua ruiah mih chekhai. Mami bowih kowi dow Josua kruitownra hown Kanan pren kowi Israeluüa kowkup hanow nakowi kowpowng krawng bawn mih lawnguan kowi arui uowi chekhai. Israeluüa kowi napeah pren kownkow Thurai takhamta mih dow mami bowih kowi uang tachi khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh lang kaah tekra mih dow Israeluüa pown Jawrdan aw mih, Jeriko marow kowi Israeluüa piakah mih, Ai marow kowi Israeluüa senah mih hai aia maru-uüa hown Thurai plan tatow sangbowk laitawm mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih laiklow dow, “CHAKRAMANG kowi che enni chupiia kown nau dowi now mia kowi chow enni nachupiia kown nau mih ani ruiah büa diah. Iufratis aw paipra pown kowi uowi khe kowh enni pipu-uüa chupiiaah mih thuraiuüa kowi bow enni nachupiia kown? Nadowi now kawmat kowh enni uowiah mih pren kowi kowh Amawruüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi bow enni nachupiia kown? Tawkche ang hai ang kimchakuüa tarapdow CHAKRAMANG kowi chowtaih nachupiia kown,” pami chekhai (24:15).</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Lawngrawi: Lawngrawi pami dow hungh pre buk takra kowi dowm iawng anaima mih arah kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Akeng thuraiuüa: Akeng thuraiuüa pami dow Thurai ching nadowi. Nami dow arup aren kowi changla thurai mih kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Tap: Tap pami dow rumla marow mih khah chekhai. Nami dow ransu-uüa uang sen marow khe alak kowi nauang ia kupla dowi kownkow akhawtma thawpah mih khah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Sünghi: Sünghi pami dow pren hai pren tabak mih kowi kowh amat müa chekhai. Nami dow en kowh süng ang kowh süng pami tuk matla müa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Nowng awngta Kanan pren mih 1:1-12:24</para>
  <para style="io1">Powng krawng mih 13:1-21:45</para>
  <para style="io2">Jawrdan satlawt pra kowh süng 13:1-33</para>
  <para style="io2">Jawrdan satkup pra kowh süng 14:1-19:51</para>
  <para style="io2">Tatung tanimra marow 20:1-9</para>
  <para style="io2">Leviuüa kowh marow 21:1-45</para>
  <para style="io1">Satlawt prakowi uowi miuüa amatni uowi rah kowi plan mih 22:1-34</para>
  <para style="io1">Achur kowi Josua mala lai mih 23:1-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Sekem kowi tatow sangbowk laitawm mih 24:1-33</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s">Josua kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh nar chekhai. Mosi kowh akhowng mih dow Nun kowh chapa Josua chekhai. Mosi kowng kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />“Ang kowh nar Mosi dow kowng khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih en hai maiawngün Israeluüa mih haipown Jawrdan aw diah. Now ang nape enni kown mih pren kowi kowkowi büa diah. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Enni krawi chawpah mih arah maten dow ang pe enni khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami laiklow dow Mosi kowi ang khamta khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Enni kowh pren sünghi dow mrawkphak pra kowh süngrüp süngkangma hownia tawngphak pra kowh Lebanawn hungh mowr, now satlawt pra kowh Iufratis awma hownia satkup pra kowh Mediteranean sata mowr chekhai. Enni kowh pren kowi mih Hit chenchapuüa kowh süng paw tawi uowi khai. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />En sing uowi mowr dow miapaw naia kingküa en kown nadowi. Mosi tut-e ang tawi uowi reng iawng en tut-e paw ang natawi uowi reng kown taih. Ang dow katpaw napowtta en kown nadowi, now nua paw ang nanuata en kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />“Napeah pren kownkow enni kowh pipu-uüa tut-e ang takham khowk. Nami pren dow maiawngün maru-uüa kowi en napowng pe kown. Naiawng rakowi sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah diah. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah diah. Now ang kowh nar Mosi pe en mih rirow maten chünah kaneu diah. Nami rirow hownia hawmlawm pra lah, lakuai pra lah en nacham süt kown nadowi. Nahanow en cham kowi rah srui kowi en naiung kown. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih maten en mih phatah diah. Nami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih maten en naia chünla reng kownkow ni towng iak towng tuakah diah. Nahanow en changah mih lup srui naiung kown. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Ang kowh mami ana pek sak kowi towah diah. En mih sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah diah. Hangkow kram diah, now sak paw hangkow nenah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow lowra mih re-e natawi uowila en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel aluchowuüa kowi Josua peah ana mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Nami laiklow ta hanow aluchowuüa kowi Josua tek pe mih, <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />“Tangbung khup rah kowi kowkowiah now maru kawmuüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe büa diah: CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren enni nakowpowng kownkow mami hownia sum ni tuang kowi Jawrdan aw enni napown kown takla. Naiawng rakowi enni matia kowh chakkham kamrütla büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satlawt pra kowh Israeluüa kowi Josua peah ana mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten hai Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa kowi Josua tek pe mih, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi pe enni ana mih laiklow tukah büa diah. Aia tek enni mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih pe tanai enni khai, now aia dow mami pren pe enni khai,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Enni kowh masi, chauüa hai tawncher hawmh dow makowi nata uowi kown. Nachenganchepaw enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tasen uang khowk mih maten dow enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi enni natawi khowngah tasen kownkow Jawrdan aw narik pown kown takla. <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />CHAKRAMANG pe enni süng iawng enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi paw CHAKRAMANG napeah süng kown. Tawkchedow enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG pe powngah dowi mowr enni natawi hing khowngta hüah kown takla. Nami kung kowi chiang CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi pe enni mih Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi kowh süng kowi enni nauang ia uowi kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Nakhowk khe Josua kowi amatni tek pe mih, “En pe anging mih ana maten anging nachün kown, now en chin anging mih arah re-e anging nakowkowi kown. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Mosi kowh ana pek maten anging chün iawng en kowh ana pek paw anging nachün kown. CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai mih Mosi tut-e tawi uowi reng iawng en tut-e paw pacham tawi uowi reng lah. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />En kowh ana pek kingküa hai chün dowi mih maru kowi dow kowngta kown takla. En mih sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah diah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s">Kowkumü miuüa kowi Rahab lawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Sittim pami arah kowi uowi büah reng tak khe Nun kowh chapa Josua mih nakowkumü Kanan pren kownkow kowchin maru pre ia khai. Aia kowchinah mih maru kowi Josua krawi tek pe mih, “Kanan pren kowi kowkowi iüah now pren hai marow mih kowkumü iüa diah. Amülüngma hown Jeriko marow mih krawi kumüla kaneu iüa diah,” pape khai. Nahanow nami maru pre ia dow Jeriko marow kowi kowkowi khai bowt. Now amatchi dow Rahab pami <char style="w">chawkkrawma</char> kim kowi kowpün hanow iak iüah khai.<verse eid="JOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Now uang krawi kumü pren kownkow sat kowi prakowi Israeluüa uang ting ne pami satang dow Jeriko marow mang paw tawi ta khai bowt. <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Nami satang tata hanow Jeriko marow mang mih Rahab tut-e kowchin maru sangrum khai. Mang kowchinah mih maru-uüa kowtek pe Rahab mih, “En kim kowi kowh uang pün mih maru-uüa dow uang kumü pren kownkow uang mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi uang lawtla diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4-6" />Rahab klangah mih, “Ow, ang kim kowi maru uang nowm chowdiah. Tawkchedow tawng hownia chünchü uang mih ang tuk dowi. Sat kowi prakowi alai büng marow <char style="w">tapplawt</char> dowi rawn khe mang iüah tüng khowk. Tawng pra chow cham mang iüah mih ang tuk dowi. Nachenganchepaw kawmat che enni kowkowi krawi hanow enni krawi ia um tak chepaw naia,” pape khai. (Kowkumü pren mih maru pre ia kowi Rahab dow aia kimluk kowi petta hüah chekhai. Aia dow kimluk kowi kowh diata mih kankung la hown nami maru pre ia kowi khuta hüah chekhai). <verse eid="JOS 2:4-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Naiawng rakowi mang uang chinah mih maru-uüa dow Rahab kowh laiklow tata hanow kowkumü pren mih maru pre ia kowi kowkawi krawi kownkow nami Jeriko marow hownia lawt khai bowt. Nami marow hownia amatni lawt krowngchow now marow tapplawt dow büngta khai bowt. Amatni dow Jawrdan aw nowng pownah krowngchow mih pra kowh tiama prakowi kowkrawi tarü khai.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8-9" />Amatchi müi dowi rawn tak khe Rahab mih aia kimluk kowi kowpün khai. Amatchi kowi aia tek pe mih, “Mami pren dow CHAKRAMANG peta enni mih chowbowt pami ang tuk. Enni kowi lainowmma anging kram chekhai. Kram enni lai bowt rakowi mami prenchakuüa dow chürla kluk towbowt. <verse eid="JOS 2:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt kung kowi enni pur kowi kowh sata Rik tui tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG pe kangah mih anging ta chekhai. Jawrdan aw satlawt pra pown kowi kowh Amawruüa mang Sihun hai Awk iüah kowi tawng iawng ngai chow enni changah mih paw anging ta chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Naiawngün satang tata hanow lainowmma anging kram khai. Naiawng rakowi nauang sen enni kown mih miapaw uam dowi bowt chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow krawng hai mukuang Thurai chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12-13" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ming hown ang tut-e takham iüa diah. Kawmat kowh ang saksing sana enchi iawng dow ang hai ang kimchakuüa kowi paw enchi nasaksing sana anging kown takla. Au apa, ang tainau-uüa hai amatni kowh kimchakuüa kowi kowngra hownia enchi nape plai anging kown takla. Now enchi nasaksing sana anging kown mih ang natukla kownkow pela ang amat müa lowk diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 2:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Nami laiklow tata hanow kowiüah tek pe Rahab mih, “Anging kowh maiawngün sangkrangra dow mia kowi paw hang cham tek diah. En che cham tek dowi hanow mami pren CHAKRAMANG pe powng anging mih khin khe enni vüi iung müa anging nachang enni kown taih, now kaah sakowmma hai angching nachang enni kown. Angching tek en iawng chang en dowi hanow enni nakowng kown mih takcha angching pacham kowng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Rahab kowh kim dow marow <char style="w">tap</char> hown achawn sang chekhai. Aia mih tawngpawk hownia iu iang pe leng hanow nami maru pre ia kowi iu pe dowmah khai. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Amatchi iu dowm dowi rawn khe Rahab tek pe mih, “Kawikrawi enchi miuüa nakrum enchi dowi kownkow hungh prakowi kowpowt iüa diah. Sum ni mowr mih hungh kowi tapet iüa diah. Kawikrawi enchi miuüa uang plan kung kowi khe mang iüah iang,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Nakhowk khe kowiüah tek pe Rahab mih, “En tek iawng nachang en kown mih angching takham khowk. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Nachenganchepaw maiawng en nachang kown takla: Mami pren kowi anging uang plan kup mih khin khe kawmat kowh en klala angching mih leng aringma mih mami tawngpawk kowi natasük hüah kown takla. Now en u en pa, en tainau-uüa hai en pa kimchakuüa maten kowi mih en kim kowi en natowah kown takla. Naiawng che en chang dowi hanow angching kham en iawng angching chang en dowi chepaw angching luk kowi aprek nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Nami khin khe en kim hownia kowh lawt mih maru dow tawi kowng khai chepaw aia kowng mih aprek aia chowtaih nakur kown; aia kowng mih aprek dow angching nakur kown nadowi. Tawkche en kim kowi uowi khowk chepaw anging kowh maru kakla kowh tawi kowng khai hanow nami maru kowng mih aprek dow angching nakur kown taih. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Nachenganchepaw anging kowh kamrütra lawnguan che en cham phuangta khai hanow angching kham en iawng angching chang en dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Nakhowk khe Rahab klangah mih, “Ow, enchi tek iawng pacham na lah,” pape khai. Nami kung kowi dow taprai büah khai bowt. Now kowiüah mang kung kowi dow aringma mih leng mih tawngpawk kowi Rahab sükta hüah khai.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Nami maru pre ia dow nami hownia powt hanow hungh kowi sum ni mowr kowtapet khai. Now amatchi kowi kowh kawikrawiah miuüa dow amatchi kowi krawikrum dowi rakowi uang plan khai bowt. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru pre ia mih hungh hownia iu dowm hanow haipown Jawrdan aw khai, now amatni Israeluüa uowi rah kowi kowkowi khai. Amatchi dow Josua tut-e kowkowi hanow amatchi luk kowi tawng ngai chow own mih kowlawp pe iüah khai. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Josua kowi amatchi tek pe mih, “Kanan pren paprenma mih a-i rut kowi CHAKRAMANG apta mih chowbowt pami lainowm chekhai. Kram a-i rakowi Kanan prenchak maten dow chürla kluk towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa pown Jawrdan aw mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Auai rau murpa awr rü hanow Josua hai Israeluüa maten Sittim hownia lawt büah khai, now Jawrdan aw ria re-e kowkowi büah khai. Amatni dow pown Jawrdan aw dowi mowr nakowi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2-3" />Now sum ni kung kowi dow aluchowuüa mih tangbung khup rah maten kowi kowkrawi kowi khai. Now krawi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</char> uamowuüa kawtla mih enni khi khe enni matia kowh uowi rah hownia amatni kung kowi enni nakawikrawi kown. <verse eid="JOS 3:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Nami tiama iawng katpaw enni uang mang dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi uamowuüa mih narik tüng enni tiama kownkow narik mang kown. Tawkchedow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla re-e enni naia tatawn kown nadowi. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hownia alak 2,000 muk ngia enni nauowi kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Nami kung kowi Josua tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Tharau dow enni pungmadawng kowi awdara lup ahuma CHAKRAMANG nachang kown. Naiawng rakowi enni matia mih tachim tasai büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Nami kung kowi Josua tek pe uamowuüa mih, “Enni mih sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawtla now maru kawmuüa pur kowi Jawrdan aw rik pown büa diah,” pakhai. Nahanow uamowuüa dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawtla now maru kawmuüa pur kowi rik mang khai.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, “Ani hownia bowt now Israeluüa maten tut-e lang kri mih aluchow ang nachang en kown. Nahanow amatni dow Mosi tut-e ang tawi uowila reng iawng en tut-e paw ang tawi uowila en reng pami natuk büah kown. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih uamowuüa kowi en napeah ana kown mih, ‘Enni mih Jawrdan aw pang re-e kowtowm khowk now tui kowi iowng büa diah,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Nami kung kowi Josua tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Mami re-e uang büa diah. Now CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tekah mih laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Masing Thurai dow enni tut-e uowi reng pami hai aia dow Kananuüa, Hituüa, Hivuüa, Perizuüa, Girgasuüa, Amawruüa hai Jebusuüa kowi enni hownia naprütta kown mih maiawng enni natuk kown. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11-13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11-13" />Palusama kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uamowuüa nakawtla now narik pown Jawrdan aw kown. Jawrdan aw tui kowi amatni kowchawp hown krowksang takling nurlur mih tui nauang taklu bowk kown, now talowng phunglung mih tui maten tap iawng naiowng hüah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 3:11-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow napown Jawrdan aw kownkow lut tangbung büah khai bowt, now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih uamowuüa rik mang khai. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15-16" />Nami khin dow luprak kua khin chekhai. Luprak kua khin dow Jawrdan aw tui atekma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih uamowuüa kowchawp Jawrdan aw tui hown krowksang hawr dawilawi mih tui dow uang taklu khai. Now nami tui dow uamowuüa khawk chawpra hownia Zarethan marow re-e kowh Adam marow ria mowr tui süng awr pün khai. Naiawng rakowi khawk chawpra hownia Sata Kowng mowr tui hawr dowi chekhai. Nahanow Jeriko marow re-e nami Jawrdan aw Israeluüa haipown khai. <verse eid="JOS 3:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Israeluüa maten nowng pown Jawrdan aw dowi mowr dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih uamowuüa mih tui takra kowi kowh bawn kangma mih kowi iowng büa khai. Now Israeluüa maten dow bawn kangma mih iawng haipown büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Gilgal arah kowi chowk hua laipre buk mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi Israeluüa maten kowting mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Pachen kowi lowk ia chi bowkbowk kowi laipre ia rui maru diah. <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />Now Jawrdan aw dawnglang kowi uamowuüa iowngra hownia aiuk sangrum mih hua kowpe pawah laipre buk diah. Naiawngün hua dow aiak kowh enni cham iakra kowi natowah kownkow amatni kowi pe kawtla diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4-5" />Naiawng rakowi Josua mih Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia pakrungchak kowi lowk ia chi bowkbowk kowi klo maru laipre ia khai. Naiawngün aia kloah mih maru-uüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “Jawrdan aw kowi iu dowm büah hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla re-e kowkowi büa diah. Now nami arah hownia enni Israel laipre krungchak vüi lowk ia e lowk chi bowkbowk kowi laipre buk kowkawt hua büa diah. <verse eid="JOS 4:4-5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6-7" />Naiawngün hua dow enni vüi amat müa naown kown. Naiawngün hua lawnguan kowi pur prakowi enni kowh chauüa nalünta enni kown. Nami khin khe enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Jawrdan aw kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla a-i uaipownla mih khin khe Jawrdan aw tui taak lang khai. Naiawng rakowi nami lawnguan a-i natukla reng kownkow maiawngün hua a-i Israeluüa vüi chowngchowng saksakma amat müa chekhai,’ napape kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 4:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Israeluüa dow Josua kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana pek iawng chang khai bowt. Amatni dow amatni Israel laipre krungchak vüi Jawrdan aw dawnglang hownia aiukma kangowh mih hua kowkawt laipre buk khai. Now naiawngün hua dow amatni cham iakra kowi cham towah khai.<verse eid="JOS 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawtla mih uamowuüa iowngra re-e Josua dow aiuk sangrum mih hua kowchowk laipre buk khai. Naiawngün hua dow kawmat pat nami re-e uowi reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Napown Jawrdan aw kown mih lawnguan maru kawmuüa kowi natek pe kownkow Josua kowi Mosi pela ana khai. Naiawng rakowi Josua dow nami powm iawng maru kawmuüa kowi tek pe khai. Achang takla mih srui amatni ki changta bowk dowi mowr uamowuüa dow aw dawnglang kowi iowng hüah khai, now maru kawmuüa dow sakkrowngma hown haipown Jawrdan aw khai.<verse eid="JOS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11-18" />Mosi pela ana iawng Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten, now Manase krungchak dawnglang mih natawi dowk tasen kownkow kamrütma hown Israeluüa pur kowi rik pown Jawrdan aw khai. Nacham dowk tasen kownkow maru iun 40,000 ia ngia mih tasen müa <char style="w">rutchün khawkleng</char> dowkma hown CHAKRAMANG kowi khepla se haipown aw hanow Jeriko marow re-e kowh dowm nai kowi kowuowi khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 4:11-18">Nami kung kowi kowh ta lat mih Israeluüa dow haipown Jawrdan aw khai. Nakhowk khe Josua kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Kawtla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih uamowuüa kowi Jawrdan aw hownia nauai pün bowt kownkow peah ana diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Jawrdan aw hownia nauai pün bowt kownkow uamowuüa kowi Josua peah ana khai. Now kawtla CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih uamowuüa dow Jawrdan aw dawnglang hownia aw pang kowi uai pün büah khai bowt. Now süngkangma kowi uamowuüa kowchawp hown krowksang Jawrdan aw tui dow aiawng uowi iawng kutplan uowi khai iawk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 4:11-18">Naiawng hai nami ni khe Israeluüa maten naring nakawah kownkow Josua kowi CHAKRAMANG changah khai. Naiawng rakowi Mosi kowi iawng Josua kowi paw aia sing uowi mowr maru kawmuüa ringkawah khai bowt.<verse eid="JOS 4:11-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Israeluüa pown Jawrdan aw mih dow ning sar kowi kowh la uown kowi lacher hamüt ni khe chekhai. Ki pownta Jawrdan aw hanow amatni dow Gilgal pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. Gilgal dow Jeriko marow satlawt prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Now Jawrdan aw hownia kowh uang kawtla mih laipre buk mih hua dow nakowi Josua chowkah khai. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Nami kung kowi dow aia tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Pur prakowi maiawngün hua lawnguan kowi enni kowh chauüa nalünta enni kown. <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Nakhowk khe enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Maiawngün hua dow a-i Israeluüa akang khawngma mih Jawrdan aw haipown mih lawnguan natukla reng kown mih amat müa chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Mami pren kowi a-i Israeluüa uang kup kownkow uaipown Jawrdan aw khe Jawrdan aw rephai akang khawngma mih luk iawng a-i uaimang khai. Uaipown sata Rik khe a-i ia pown bowk dowi mowr sata Rik phai akang khawngma CHAKRAMANG chang a-i iawng mami Jawrdan aw a-i uaipown khe paw CHAKRAMANG chang a-i khai. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />Naiawng CHAKRAMANG chang mih dow aia kowh rut akürma mih palusama maru natukla kownkow hai CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi chowngchowng saksakma ringkawma hown a-i nakramah kownkow chekhai,’ napape kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Israeluüa uaipown Jawrdan aw khe tawng iawng chow Israeluüa pur kowi Jawrdan aw tui CHAKRAMANG pe kangah mih satang dow Jawrdan aw satkup pra kowh Amawruüa mang maten hai sata pang kowi kowh Kananuüa mang maten tawi ta khai. Nami satang tata hanow naiawngün manguüa mih lainowmma takrow khai bowt, now amatni kowh sakowmra maten paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Amatni dow Israeluüa hown tadowk tasen kown khowm padow uam büah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi plan hiah pe khampha uanh pik mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Gilgal pami arah kowi Israeluüa uowi reng tak khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, “Josua, cham paw pe huaran sangrum hanow saichow iawng thawpah diah, now nami huaran hown alai kowh iawng Israeluüa kowi hiah pe <char style="w">khampha uanpik</char> diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Josua dow huaran hown thawp saichow sangrum khai. Now Gibeat-Haralawt hungh kowi nami huaran hown Israeluüa kowi Josua hiah pe khampha uanpik khai. Gibeat-Haralawt pami dow “Khampha uanpik hiah rah hungh” pami chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4-7" />Israeluüa kowi naiawng Josua hiah pe khampha uanpik mih auan dow maiawng: Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt khe kowh tasen uang khowk mih kachakuüa maten hiah khampha uanpik khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw naiawngünuüa dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi khe CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nakhowk khe naiawngünuüa kowi dow iawn tui hai kuai tui atekma mih pren natawi khi dowi kownkow CHAKRAMANG khamah khai. Nami pren mih napeah kownkow amatni pipu-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG khamah khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow aia kowh laiklow chün dowi rakowi kowng bowk dowi mowr süngrüp süngkangma kowi CHAKRAMANG pe krawi lenah panglang khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowng bowk kung kowi dow naiawngün maru-uüa kowh chauüa kowi amatni takcha CHAKRAMANG ta peah pren khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh chauüa dow Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt kung kowi tiama rawng kowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh dia mih chekhai. Tiama rawng kowi kowh dia miuüa kowi dow hiah pe khampha uanpik dowi tak rakowi Josua hiah pe khampha uanpik mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 5:4-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Naiawng hai kachakuüa maten kowi dow hiata pe khampha uanpik bowk khai. Now khampha uanpik hiah lawi lep dowi mowr dow amatni kowh tangbung khup rah kowi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, “Aigupta pren kowi kowh enni uowi nar mih rukraira maten ani hownia now ang henta enni mih chowbowt,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi nami re-e kowh arah ming dow Gilgal pahai Israeluüa chap pe khai. (Gilgal pami auan dow “Henta” pami chekhai). Nami arah ming dow kawmat pat Gilgal pahai maru tukah reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanan pren kowi Israeluüa rik sunah mih Takat Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Nami la kowi kowh laitali ni mih ni khe dow sat kup hownia now Israeluüa mih sun Takat Pawi khai. Nami Takat Pawi Israeluüa sun mih dow Jeriko marow re-e kowh Gilgal pami dowm nai kowi khup tangbung büah khe chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Auai ni hownia now Kanan pren kowi kowh luprak hown kowh thawpah mih kawm ngai hai the pe <char style="w">tuah</char> dowi mih kawm Israeluüa cha khai bowt. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Kanan pren kowi kowh luprak Israeluüa uown cha mih auai ni hownia bowt now <char style="w">manna kawm</char> mih katpaw uang dowh dowi bowt. Nami ni hownia bowt now Israeluüa mih katpaw ka cha manna kawm dowi bowt chekhai. Nami ning hownia Israeluüa dow Kanan pren kowi kowh luprak towbowt cha khai.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh siphai aluchow hown Josua takrum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Jeriko marow re-e Israeluüa kowting mih khin khe saidawng howkma mih maru Josua pur kowi uang iowng mih aia khi lowk ia khai. Nami maru kowi Josua lüntaah mih, “Mia pra kowh tangi mih maru chow en? Anging pra kowh tangi mih bow, dowdow anging kowh ransu-uüa pra kowh tangi mih maru bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Nakhowk khe nami maru tek pe Josua mih, “Ang dow mia pra paw tangi mih maru nadowi. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG kowh siphai aluchow chekhai. Kawmat mih en tut-e ang uang mih chekhai,” pape khai. Nami laiklow tata now Josua dow tabawkah krawm se nami maru kowi chupah khai. Now Josua lüntaah mih, “<char style="w">Chakramang</char>, ang dow en kowh nar chowtaih. Tawng chow en tek ang kown nau mih tek diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh siphai aluchow tek pe Josua mih, “Kawmat kowh en iowngah mih arah dow chimsaima chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh phanaikhawk klüpta diah,” pape khai. Josua dow nami maru tek iawng chang khai.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Jeriko marow piak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Jeriko marowchakuüa dow Israeluüa kowi kram rakowi amatni kowh marow tapplawt mih asima büngta büah khai. Naiawng rakowi nami marow hownia dow miapaw nowng lawt dowi bowt, now kup paw miapaw uang nowng kup dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, “Sünta diah, Jeriko marow dow ang apta en mih chowbowt. Now nami marow kowi kowh mang hai aia kowh lang kiak mih siphai hawmh paw ang apla en mih chowbowt. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Ani kowi pakat chi taruk ni mowr marow tapat lut en kowh siphai hawmh hown krawi pat büa diah. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Enni krawi pat marow mih khin khe uamow ranit ia mih napawla <char style="w">baw</char> ranit klüng hanow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih uamowuüa pur kowi tumla baw se narik mang kown. Now ranit ni mih ni khe dow marow tapat lut ranit kat enni nakrawi patah kown. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Now ruapurla nang hown kowh thawpah mih baw aiatma uamowuüa tum mih che en ta khowk hanow maru maten kowi atünma en nape hekah kown. Nahanow Jeriko marow tap dow nahing chan bun kown towbowt. Now enni Israeluüa mih marow lak kowi nakowkup kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Naiawng rakowi Nun kowh chapa Josua dow uamowuüa kowi hawah hanow tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawtla büa diah. Now ruapur nang hown kowh thawpah mih baw enni pungmadawng hownia pawla ranit klüng hanow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt miuüa pur kowi rik mang büah ranit ia diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa kowi Josua peah ana mih, “Marow tapat lut kowi kowkrawi pat büah akat diah. Now siphai hawmh dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi narik mang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8-9" />Naiawng rakowi Josua ana pek iawng ruapur nang hown kowh thawpah mih baw tumla mih uamow ranit ia pur kowi siphai hawmhuüa mih rik mang pathum khai. Nami tumla baw mih uamowuüa kung kowi dow kawtla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih uamowuüa krawi ta mang khai. Nami kung kowi paw siphai hawmh krawi ta mang pathum khai. Uamowuüa dow pat marow towng tumla baw büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 6:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow ririmma chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kawmuüa kowi Josua rik peah ana mih, “Ang tek enni dowi mowr mapaw hang hek büah. Ditchow paw hang lai büah. Ang tek enni khe chiang enni nahek kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Naiawng hai amatni dow Josua ana pek iawng CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih marow tapat lut krawi patla akat khai. Now nami kung kowi dow amatni chowlowkkow tangbung khup rah kowi uang iak büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12-13" />Auai rau murpa Josua dow awr rü khai. Now nami ni paw auown ni khe kowh iawng uamowuüa hai siphai hawmh mih marow kowi krawi pat khai iawk. Nami ni paw tumla baw mih uamow ranit ia pur kowi siphai hawmhuüa rik mang pathum khai. Nami tumla baw mih uamowuüa kung kowi dow kawtla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih uamowuüa krawi ta mang khai. Nami kung kowi paw siphai hawmh krawi ta mang pathum khai. Uamowuüa dow pat marow khe atungma hing tumla baw büa hüah khai. <verse eid="JOS 6:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Naiawng hai pre ni mih ni kowi paw amatni dow marow tapat lut krawi pat büah akat khai. Now nami kung kowi dow amatni chowlowkkow tangbung khup rah kowi uang iak büah khai. Amatni dow naiawng hai taruk ni mowr krawi pat büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Ranit ni mih ni khe dow rau-e murpa uarthowi pasum seng khe awr rü büah khai. Now nami ni paw amatni rik pat marow khe kowh changla iawng changla se marow tapat lut krawi pat büah khai. Nachenganchepaw nami ni khe dow krawi pat büah ranit kat khai. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Ranit kat pat büah mih khin khe dow uamowuüa mih aiatma tum baw khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Josua tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Atünma hek büah bowt! Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami marow dow CHAKRAMANG peta enni mih chowbowt! <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Marow hai marow lak kowi kowh uowi mih maten enni napiakta bowk kown. Now nakowi kowh uowi mih maru hai tawncher maten paw enni nasaita bowk kown. Naiawng enni chang mih dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni ap uanh mih iawng chekhai. Chawkkrawma Rahab hai aia kim kowi kowh tawi uowi mih maru ngetchow kowi taih natowah asing kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kowkumü pren kownkow a-i kowchinah mih maru-uüa kowi aia mih hawt petah khai. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Nachenganchepaw napiakta kown mih uanh maten dow mapaw enni naia pawla kown nadowi. Enni che chün lai dowi kowi pawla khai hanow enni Israeluüa kowh tangbung khup rah kowi phih nauang kla kown, now enni luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Tawkche nami marow kowi kowh kuh uanh, tai uanh, kri uanh hai lawngha uanh maten dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi lang kraah mih chekhai. Naiawngün uanh maten dow CHAKRAMANG kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi enni natowah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Uamowuüa aiatma tum baw mih tün ta hown krowksang maru kawmuüa dow akawm srui atünma hek büah khai. Now Jeriko marow tap dow chan rum khai. Nahanow maru kawm maten dow marow lak kowi kowkup khai, now marow dow powngta büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Now amatni dow marow kowi kowh uowi mih maten — masiuüa kachakuüa, lawngtang ngeu-uüa, chia, ruapur hai <char style="w">kawrngaramchük</char> ün — saita bowk khai.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Kowkumü pren kownkow kowchinah mih maru pre ia kowi Josua tek pe mih, “Chawkkrawma kowi enchi khamla pe laiklow iawng aia kim kowi kowkowi iüa diah. Now aia hai aia kim kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi uang lawtla iüa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23-25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23-25" />Naiawng rakowi nami maru pre ia dow Rahab kim kowi kowkup khai. Now amatchi dow aia hai a-u a-pa kowi, atainau-uüa hai aia kim kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi uang lawtla khai. Naiawng hai Josua mih Rahab hai aia kim kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi lawngah khai. Rahab kowh maru-uüa kowi dow Israeluüa kowh tangbung khup rah uat kowi kowh thaulangma mih arah kowi pe uowiah büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowkumü Jeriko marow kownkow Josua kowchinah mih maru pre ia kowi Rahab dow hawt petah khai. Rahab krungchakuüa dow kawmat mowr pat Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 6:23-25">Kuh uanh, tai uanh, kri uanh hai lawngha uanh maten dow CHAKRAMANG kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi Israeluüa kowtowah khai. Tawkche marow hai marow kowi kowh uowi mih akeng uanh maten dow towkta bowk khai.<verse eid="JOS 6:23-25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Nami khin khe Josua dow kham sawi se tek mih, “Mami Jeriko marow ta plan thawp mih maru luk kowi dow mami CHAKRAMANG kowh piati pacham klaah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">“Thawp marow tap mih maru kowh dow chapa ta pacham kowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 6:26">now thawp marow tapplawt mih maru kowh dow chapa sawi pacham kowng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />CHAKRAMANG dow Josua tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Now Josua kowh ming iung nang iung dow Kanan pren paprenma kowi cham krawi tauet khai.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s">Akan ngak rakowi Israeluüa sum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Jeriko marow kowi kowh uanh napiakta kownkow aia khowm bowkta mih dow tawngpaw napaw dowi kown mih Israeluüa kowi Thurai tek pe khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Juda chen kowi kowh Akan pami dow aiamat vüi Jeriko marow kowi kowh uanh mih pawla ne khai. Akan dow Karmi kowh chapa chekhai. Karmi dow Zabdi kowh chapa, now Zabdi dow Zera kowh chapa chekhai. Naiawng Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek chün dowi lowk ia rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Israel pachenma luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Jeriko marow re-e Israeluüa uowi reng tak khe nakowku paw satang kownkow Ai marow kowi Josua kowchin <char style="w">dumiow</char> sangrum khai. Ai marow uowi mih dow Bethel marow satlawt pra kowh Bet-Aven marow re-e chekhai. Aia kowchinah mih dumiowuüa kowi Josua krawi tek pe mih, “Ai marow kowi kowkowi büa diah, now nami marow krawi kumüla kaneu büa diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün dumiowuüa dow kowkowi hanow Ai marow lawnguan kowi kukpa krawi ku paw satang khai.<verse eid="JOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Now akung kowi dow uang plan hanow Josua kowi dumiowuüa uang tek pe büah mih, “Ai marow kowi dow maru iun e chowtaih. Naiawng rakowi nakowsen Ai marow kownkow maru maten tarü kla dowi. Maru maten kowi towkah kawm dowi paw. Maru iun 2,000 ia nadowi now 3,000 ia kowchin now na taih,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Naiawng rakowi maru iun hu prakowi 3,000 iachow taih Ai marow kowi kowsen kownkow tarü büah khai. Tawkche Ai marowchakuüa kowi nowng dowi kowh kowdowk tasen miuüa mih uang powt takla khai. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Ai marowchakuüa dow marow tapplawt hownia Sebarim pami arah mowr Israeluüa kowi kawikrawiah khai. Now Ai marowchakuüa dow arema mih arah kowi Israeluüa kowh siphai 36 ia kowi krawi saita khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowh sakkraingra dow hing piak bowk khai.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Nakhowk khe Josua hai Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa dow sak kowi rau lai kowh amatni kowh tawnguat thekta büah khai, now lu kowi prui dinchow büah khai. Now sat kup dowi mowr CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla re-e hing tabawk büah hüah khai <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Josua tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, tawngplawng kowchow Jawrdan aw uang pe pown anging hanow nasaita anging kownkow Amawruüa rut kowi en tuk ap anging khai? Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi phai anging uowi phülü panü lang iung tak diah. <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ransu-uüa tut-e sum kowh Israeluüa uang powt kung kowi tawng tak chow ang natek en kown? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Kananuüa hai mami pren kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa mami laiklow ta hanow nauang umta anging lut kown towbowt. Now amatni dow lusa hownia namitta anging rim kown towbowt. Nakhowk khe tawng iawng chow en kowh ming iung nang iung mih en natownah bowt kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Nakhowk khe Josua kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Awr rü! Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk tabawk khai? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Israeluüa dow chang lup ngak khai. Amatni kowi dow ang kowh sangbowk laitawm laiklow nachün kownkow ang tek pe khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw chün büah dowi. Napiakta kownkow ang khowm bowkta mih uanh maten hownia pawta büah ne khai. Amatni dow ku khai, now dai lai paw tek khai. Naiawngün uanh maten mih amatni kowh uanh hown katsang towah büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Ransu-uüa tut-e Israeluüa sum mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai. Amatni dow kung prakowi powt khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow napiakta kownkow khowm bowkta khowk chekhai. Napiakta kownkow Thurai khowm bowkta mih uanh enni tut-e uowi ne. Naiawngün uanh che enni piakta dowi hanow enni tut-e ang natawi uowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />“Awr rü! Kowkowi hanow maru kawmuüa kowi kowchimsaiah diah, now tharau khe ang pur kowi nauang kownkow pe kamrütah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG enni Israeluüa kowh Thurai natek enni kown mih, ‘Aw Israeluüa, enni pungmadawng kowi napiakta kownkow Thurai khowm bowkta mih uanh uowi ne. Naiawngün uanh alakma kowi enni cham kuakta dowi mowr dow ransu-uüa kowi enni naia kown nadowi,’ napa kown. <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Naiawng rakowi tharau rau-e khe pakrungchak pakrungchakchow ang pur kowi enni nauang iowng kown. Mia iawng mih krungchak kowi chow ang ka khüm mih nami krungchak hownia pamachak pamachak chow ang pur kowi nauang iowng kown. Now mia iawng mih machak kowi chow ang ka khüm mih nami machak hownia pakimchak pakimchakchow ang pur kowi nauang iowng kown. Now mia iawng mih kimchak kowi chow ang ka khüm mih nami kimchak dow lowk ia lowk iachow ang pur kowi nauang kown. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Now napiakta kownkow Thurai khowm bowkta mih uanh mia iawng mih maru tut-e chow uowi mih ang ka khümta hanow nami maru kowi dow aia kowh uowi mih srui hailawm maih kowi nanawmah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm chün dowi chekhai, now Israeluüa vüi rukrai pairaima mih lup chang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akan kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Naiawng rakowi Josua mih auai rau murpa pachen pachenchow Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowpawla khai. Nakhowk khe kowh ka khümta mih dow Juda chen kowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Nami kung kowi dow Juda chen hownia pakrungchak pakrungchakchow uang iowng khai. Nakhowk khe kowh ka khümta mih dow Zera krungchak kowi chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Zera krungchak hownia kowh aluchowuüa lowk iachow lowk iachow uang iowng khai. Nakhowk khe kowh ka khümta mih dow Zabdi kowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Nami kung kowi dow Zabdi kimchak hownia lowk iachow lowk iachow uang plan iowng khai. Nakhowk khe kowh ka khümta mih dow Karmi kowh chapa Akan kowi chekhai. Karmi dow Zabdi kowh chapa, now Zabdi dow Zera kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Nakhowk khe Akan kowi Josua tek pe mih, “Chapa ow, CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi rowsi kiowri diah. Now tawng chow en changta khai mih tek ang diah; hauang da ang diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Nakhowk khe Akan tek pe Josua mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi kingküala mih <char style="w">angak</char> ang changta khai nowm. Ang changta mih angak dow maiawng: <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Jeriko marow kowi a-i kowdowk tasen mih khin khe a-i nowngta kung kowi Babulawn pren hownia kowh uan klangiungma mih lowk, tai 200 iun hai adik 600 gram mih kuh klu ang khita khai. Now naiawngün uanh dow lainowmma ang ir khai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün uanh ang pawla now ang kowh tangbung lak kowi krawng kowi ang dupah khai. Naiawngün uanh dow ang tangbung lak kowi krawng kowi uowi reng, now adak nowm nowm kowi uowi mih dow tai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Nami laiklow tata now Josua mih Akan tangbung kowi kowchin maru khai. Nami maru-uüa dow kowiowmah now Akan tangbung lak kowi krawng dak kowi naiawngün uanh mih kowkhi khai, now adak nowm nowm kowi uowi mih dow tai chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Amatni dow naiawngün uanh maten tangbung lak hownia uang lawtla hanow Josua hai Israeluüa maten tut-e uang pawla khai, now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi towah büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Nami kung kowi Josua hai Israeluüa maten mih Zera krungchak Akan kowi pawla now Akhawr <char style="w">lawngrawi</char> kowi kowpawla khai. Amatni dow Akan ku pawah mih kuh, tai, uan, Akan kowh masi chauüa, Akan kowh chia, ruapur, kawrngaramchük, tangbung hai aia kowh uowi mih maten paw pawla khai. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Nami kung kowi Josua tek pe Akan mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow a-i luk kowi naiawng mih phih en uang tuk pawla khai? Ani mih en luk kowi paw CHAKRAMANG nauang pawla en phih kown,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:25">Nakhowk khe Israeluüa mih Akan kowi hua hown rik kuakah khai, now akung kowi aia kimchakuüa maten kowi paw hua hown kuakah now kowngta bowk khai. Nami kung kowi dow Akan kowh uanh uowi mih srui hailawm amatni kowi maih hown towkta bowk khai. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmarau uowi mih prowng khai bowt. Akan kowh uak tik rah luk kowi dow Israeluüa cham paw pe hua hanow akrowngrowngma chun pe khai. Naiawng rakowi nami re-e kowh arah dow nami kung hownia bowt now Akhawr lawngrawi pahai chap pe ming khai. (Akhawr pami auan dow “phih” pami chekhai). Nami hua krowng dow kawmat pat nami re-e uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Ai marow piak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, “Hangkow kram diah, now hangkow sak nen diah. En kowh siphai hawmh kowi pawla hanow kowplan sen Ai marow iawk diah. Ai marow mang, aia kowh maru-uüa, Ai marow hai nakowi kowh arah maten ang apta en mih chowbowt. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Jeriko marow hai nakowi kowh mang kowi en changah iawng Ai marow hai amatni kowh mang kowi paw en nachangah kown. Nachenganchepaw khaleng dow nami marow kowi kowh uanh hai tawncher mih enni matia vüi enni naia pawla kown. Now akung hownia nahawt dowk tasen kownkow Ai marow satkup prakowi siphai hawmh kowi en nape tapetah pathum kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Naiawng rakowi Josua dow siphai hawmh hown kowsen Ai marow kownkow kamrüt khai bowt. Aia dow tasen lang kiak mih siphai hawmh kowi lang kloah 30,000 ia hanow uar-e kowchinah khai. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi aia krawi tek pe mih, “Sünta büa diah, Ai marow satkup prakowi enni nakowtapet kown. Tawkchedow marow hownia alakma kowi enni cham ia kowi kown nadowi. Hawt dowk tasen kownkow kamrütma hown enni nauowi kown. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Now ang tut-e kowh ta uowi mih siphai hawmh hown Ai marow kowi ang nakowkowi kown. Now nami marowchakuüa dow auown khe kowh iawng nauang sen a-i kownkow nauang lawt büah kown. Nami khin khe amatni pur hownia anging napowt pe kown. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6-7" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow naka tuak kown mih, ‘Auown khe kowh iawng amatni powt mih chowbowt,’ napa büah kown. Nahanow amatni dow nakawikrawi anging kown. Now amatni kowi mih marow hownia alakma kowi anging nacham pawla kown. Naiawng alakma kowi anging cham ting mih khin khe dow tapetra hownia enni nauang lawt kown, now marow mih enni napowngta pe kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami marow dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih napeta enni kown chowbowt. <verse eid="JOS 8:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Nami marow dow enni kowpowng hanow enni natowkta kown. CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng enni nachang kown. Mami dow enni tut-e ang kowh ana pek chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Nami kung kowi dow Josua mih marow satkup prakowi nakowtapet kownkow siphai hawmh kowi kowchinah khai. Siphai hawmh kowtapetah mih arah dow Bethel hai Ai marow takra kowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Josua dow akeng mih siphai hawmh hown nami iak mih tangbung khup rah kowi ta iak khai.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Now auai rau murpa Josua mih siphai hawmh kowi kuaah khai. Nami kung kowi Josua hai Israel aluchowuüa mih siphai hawmh kowi Ai marow prakowi pawla khai bowt. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Now Josua hai siphai hawmh dow Ai marow re-e kowkowi khai. Now amatni dow Ai marow tawngphak prakowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. Ai marow hai amatni kowh tangbung khup rah takra kowi dow lawngrawi uowi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Ai marow satkup prakowi dow siphai hawmh 5,000 ia ngia Josua pe tapetah khai. Naiawngün siphai hawmh tapetah mih arah dow Bethel hai Ai marow takra kowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Naiawng nahawt dowk tasen kownkow Israeluüa dow amatni kowh siphai hawmh kowi khowm pe uowi rah khai. Amatni kowi dow Ai marow satkup prakowi pathum, now tawngphak prakowi pathum pe uowiah büah khai. Josua dow nami iak mih lawngrawi kowi iak khai.<verse eid="JOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Tawngphak pra kowh Israel siphai hawmh kowi dow Ai marow mang khita khai. Naiawng rakowi aia hai aia kowh maru-uüa dow Israeluüa hown nakowtadowk tasen kownkow auai rau murpa awr rü büah khai. Now aia hai aia kowh maru maten dow marow hownia uang lawt hanow amatni rik tasenah mih arah Jawrdan lawngrawi re-e kowkowi büah khai. Nachenganchepaw marow satkup prakowi Israel siphai hawmh hawt tapet athum mih Ai marow mang tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Josua hai Israel siphai hawmh dow Ai marowchakuüa kowi chang pe sum iow hanow süngrüp süngkangma prakowi powtta pe khai. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Nakhowk khe Josua hai Israel siphai hawmh kowi nakawikrawi kownkow Ai marow kowi kowh kachakuüa maten tahaw büah khai. Now amatni dow Josua hai Israel siphaiuüa kowi kowkrawi khai. Naiawng hai Ai marowchakuüa kowi dow marow hownia alakma kowi Israel siphai hawmhuüa cham pawla khai. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Ai marow hai Bethel marow kowi kowh kachakuüa maten dow tawi krawi Israeluüa bowk chekhai; nakowi dow kachakuüa lowk iachow khowm ta lawt dowi bowt chekhai. Now amatni dow marow tapplawt paw ta hola hüah chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, “En kowh reh mih Ai marow prakowi haiparah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami marow dow ang napeta en kown chowbowt,” pakhai. Nahanow Josua dow aia kowh reh mih Ai marow prakowi haiparah khai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Naiawng Josua haipar reh mih dow marow satkup prakowi kowh tapet mih siphai hawmh haikhi khai. Now amatni dow tapetra hownia uang lawt hanow marow prakowi kowiowm khai. Amatni dow marow kowi kowkup hanow kowpowngta khai, now marow dow lenlenma towkta büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20-21" />Now marow hownia kuang pra maikhük chai lawmlawm mih dow Josua hai siphai hawmh haikhi khai. Now amatni dow tapet mih siphai hawmh powngta marow khowk pami tuk büah khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Josua hai siphai hawmh dow Ai marowchakuüa kowi plan senah khai bowt. Ai marowchakuüa paw kung prakowi haimü hanow amatni kowh marow hownia maikhük chai lawmlawm mih haikhita büah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow tawng prakowi paw ia powt dowi bowt chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow süngrüp süngkangma prakowi kowh powt mih Josua hai siphai hawmh dow Ai marowchakuüa kowi senah khai bowt. <verse eid="JOS 8:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Now tapet mih siphai hawmh paw Ai marowchakuüa kowi nauang senah kownkow marow hownia uang lawt büah khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Ai marowchakuüa dow Israel siphai hawmh pre thum mih takra kowi takhang büah khai. Israel siphai hawmh dow amatni kowi saita bowk khai; amatni dow lowk iachow kowi paw pe plaiah dowi, now powt paw nowng powt büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Nachenganchepaw Ai marow mang kowi dow asing khümla hanow Josua tut-e kowpawla büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Marow uat kowi kowh kawikrawi Israel siphai hawmh mih Ai marowchakuüa kowi saita büah bowk kung kowi dow Israel siphai hawmh maten mih Ai marow kowi kowplan kowi khai. Now amatni dow nami marow kowi kowh ta sing miuüa maten kowi paw saita bowk khai. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Nami ni dow Ai marow kowi kowh uowi mih maten masiuüa kachakuüa bowkbowk kowi 12,000 ia kowng khai. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Ai marow kowi kowh maru-uüa kowng bowk dowi mowr Josua dow aia kowh reh hailawm rut mih hing parta hüah chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Now marow kowi kowh tawncher hai uanh maten dow Israeluüa pawla bowk khai. Nami dow Josua tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng amatni chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Josua hai aia kowh siphai hawmh dow Ai marow mih towkah khai. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi apiakma hing uowi khai. Nami marow dow kawmat paw naiawng hai uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Ai marow mang kowi kowngta hanow sat kup dowi mowr singh kowi natarta hüah kown mih aia maru-uüa kowi Josua peah ana khai. Now sat kup khe dow singh hownia uang klala uak hanow marow tapplawt mowr kowi aia pe kuakah khai. Nami uak luk kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih kowkrowng pe hua khai. Nami hua krowng dow kawmat paw uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebal hungh kowi phat sangbowk laitawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Akung kowi Josua dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi Ebal hungh kowi thawp phuchuara lowk khai. <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />Nami phuchuara dow Israeluüa kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi ana pek iawng thawpah khai. Mosi kowh rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng rowprowp Josua mih phuchuara dow thawpah khai. Nami phuchuara dow bawpah dowi mih hua hown, now rutchün khawkleng takak dowi mih hown thawpah khai. Nami phuchuara luk kowi dow Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih <char style="w">uanap</char> hai taking tasangra uanap chang büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Ebal hungh luk kowi dow Josua mih hua luk kowi Mosi rirow plan ruiah khai. Nami khin khe Israeluüa mih tawi khi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Israeluüa maten — amatni kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa, maru iukuüa, tara chet miuüa hai amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa dow — iowngah pre thum khai. Pathum mih kung pra dow Gerizim hungh uowi chekhai, now alowk mih thum kung pra dow Ebal hungh uowi chekhai. Now amatni takra kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uowi khai. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih uamowuüa dow amatni pre thum pur kowi chekhai. Naiawng nachang kown mih ana dow CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi mih Israeluüa kowi peah prasi mih khin khe rik tekla khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Nami kung kowi dow rirow bowih kowi kowh prasi laiklow hai piati laiklow maten arui uowi iawng rowprowp Josua phat pe khai. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Mosi ana pek kowi kowh laiklow kowi Josua dow alungchow khowm padow batla dowi chekhai. Naiawng phat mih khin khe masiuüa, ngeuüa hai amatni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa hailawm Israeluüa maten uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Hivuüa kuanah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1-2" />Jawrdan aw satkup prakowi kowh uowi mih manguüa dow Jeriko marow hai Ai marow kowi Israeluüa awngta mih satang tawi ta khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow takrüpah hanow Israeluüa kowi nasenah kownkow arasang takua talawm büah khai. Naiawngün manguüa dow Hituüa, Amawruüa, Kananuüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa kowh mang chekhai. Amatni uowi mih dow hungma mawngma süng kowi, dowm nai kowi hai Mediteranean sata pang maten hownia Lebanawn hungh mowr chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 9:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3-4" />Jeriko marow hai Ai marow kowi Josua senah mih lawnguan tata hanow Gibeawn marow kowi kowh Hivuüa dow Israeluüa kowi kuanah kownkow chang prengia khai. Amatni dow amatni kowh marow hownia maru sangrum kowi Josua tut-e kowchinah khai. Amatni dow sala tuh hown kowh thawpah mih uanthup hai chak pik hown kowh thawpah mih grep tui towk rah im atuma panow atüknama mih kawrngaramchük luk kowi tangla büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 9:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />Amatni dow atuma mih hai asownnama mih phanaikhawk kruala büah khai, now tawnguat paw aprimma mih khupla büah khai. Now tiama rawng kowi kowh chakkham iawng hai pawla büah mih kawm dow mawd kowh tadi nak mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Naiawng hai amatni dow Gilgal kowi kowh Israeluüa tangbung khup rah kowi Josua tut-e kowting khai. Amatni dow Josua hai Israeluüa kowi tek pe mih, “Anging dow pren lakma hownia kowh uang mih chekhai; anging hown tatow taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Nakhowk khe Hivuüa kowi Israeluüa tek pe mih, “Anging hown atawnchow enni uowi mih amia chow tuk? Anging hown atawnchow che enni uowi hanow enni hown anging ia tatow sangbowk laitawm dowi tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Hivuüa tek pe Josua mih, “Anging dow en kowh nar chowtaih,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:8">Nakhowk khe Hivuüa kowi Josua lüntaah mih, “Mia chow enni? Tawng hownia kowh enni uang mih chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Now Hivuüa klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai ming iung nang iung ta kowh pren lakma hownia en naruüa uang mih chekhai. Aigupta pren kowi CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai changah mih satang paw anging ta chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />Nami klen kowi Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Hesbawn marow mang Sihun hai Astarte marow kowi kowh uowi mih Basan pren mang Awk iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG changah mih satang paw anging ta chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Naiawng rakowi tiama rawng kowi nachaah kown mih chakkham pawla now enni hown nauang takrum kownkow anging kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa hai anging prenchakuüa pe anging ana khai. Now anging hown enni natatow sangbowk laitawm kown mih laiklow natek enni kown mih paw krawi pe anging ana khai. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Enni hown nauang takrum kownkow kim hownia anging uang lawt khe dow tiama rawng kowi nachaah kownkow anging uang pawla mih kawm adenchow chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow naiawngün kawm mih mawd kowh tadi bowk khowk; mow sam mü büah madiah. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Now anging uang pawla mih im paw asarma chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow maiawngün im paw tapük bowk khowk. Anging uang tarüla mih arah la lai rakowi anging uang kruala mih phanaikhawk hai uang khupla mih tawnguat paw tuh bowk khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Israeluüa mih chakkham dow hawt mü pe khai. Nachenganchepaw Thurai naukrang dow Thurai tut-e lüntala büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Josua mih Hivuüa hown tatow taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm khai. Aia dow amatni kowi nasaiah dowi kownkow amatni tut-e kham sawi khai. Israel aluchowuüa paw nami lawnguan kowi tawi kham sawi khai.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Tatow sangbowk laitawm mih sum ni kung kowi dow amatni riaret kowi taih Hivuüa uowi pami Israeluüa tukta khai bowt. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kowkrawi mü Hivuüa uowi rah kownkow tarü khai bowt. Now sum ni kowh ni khe dow Hivuüa kowh marow kowi kowtowm büah khai. Hivuüa uowiah mih marow dow Gibeawn, Chephira, Berawt hai Kiriat-Jearim chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa mih Hivuüa kowi senah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh aluchowuüa mih Hivuüa hown CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai ming hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih amatni kowh aluchowuüa luk kowi sak-ih dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Naiawng kowh Israeluüa kowi amatni kowh aluchowuüa tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai ming hown amatni tut-e anging towta sangbowk laitawm khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi amatni luk kowi tawngpaw a-i nowng chang dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Amatni kowi che a-i saita hanow a-i khamta sawi mih piakta rakowi CHAKRAMANG nakunmarau a-i kown chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow a-i nasaiah kown nadowi. <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Amatni kowi a-i pe singah towbowt. Tawkchedow amatni kowi a-i kowh sawp pawk mih hai tui towng mih a-i nachangla kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Nami kung kowi Hivuüa kowi hawah now Josua tek pe mih, “Enni hown alakma anging uowi pami tawngplawng kowchow enni tuk tek anging khai? Anging ria kowi taih lowmow enni uowi. <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Naiawng enni dai rakowi kawmat mih enni ka piati khowk. Enni mih ang kowh Thurai kim vüi kowi kowh tui towng mih hai sawp pawk mih nachowng kown. Maiawng mih nar lup chang hownia tawng nam khe paw enni nakhalat kown nadowi bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Nakhowk khe Josua kowi Hivuüa klangah mih, “Mami pren paprenma nape enni kownkow hai mami prenchak maten kowi nachumta bowk kownkow CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai mih aia nar Mosi kowi peah ana khai. Nami satang anging paw achima tawi ta chekhai. En rakowi anging kram kowng kowh maiawng mih lup anging chang mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Kawmat dow en rut kowi towbowt anging uowi. En nau iawng chang anging towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa rut hownia amatni kowi mih Josua lawngah khai. Amatni kowi dow saiah büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Nami ni hownia now Israeluüa vüi hai CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara vüi napaw sawp kown mih hai natowng tui kown mih Hivuüa kowi Josua peah ana khai. Naiawng rakowi ani mowr paw amatni dow nami lup chang reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Arasang sat iowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Josua mih Ai marow kowi nowngta kowh asaima piakta khai. Jeriko marow hai mang kowi kowh changah iawng Ai marow hai mang kowi paw aia changah khai. Nami satang dow Jerusalem marow mang Adoni-Zedek tawi ta khai. Nami klen kowi Gibeawnuüa dow Israeluüa hown tatow taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm khai bowt, now Israeluüa hown tawi taiua uowi khai bowt pami paw Jerusalem marow mang tawi ta khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Naiawngün ta rakowi Jerusalem marow mang hai aia kowh maru-uüa dow lainowmma kram khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Gibeawnuüa kowh marow dow marow kri iawng aiukma chekhai. Kowbüah kowh marow dow Ai marow lak-e paw lang iuk chekhai, now nami marow kowi kowh kachakuüa hawmh paw akürma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Naiawng rakowi Jerusalem mang Adoni-Zedek mih Hebrawn marow mang Hoham, Jarmut marow mang Piram, Lakhis marow mang Jafia hai Eglawn marow mang Debir büah kowi krawi peah satang khai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />“Gibeawnuüa mih Josua hai Israeluüa hown tatow taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Gibeawnuüa kowh marow kowsen kown mih uang tawi khowng ang büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Amawruüa kowh mang tanga ia dow — Jerusalem marow mang, Hebrawn marow mang, Jarmut marow mang, Lakhis marow mang hai Eglawn marow mang — amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi arasang kuaah khai. Amatni dow amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi pawla now Gibeawn marow re-e kowkhup tangbung khai, now Gibeawn marowchakuüa kowi senah büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Nakhowk khe Gilgal kowi kowh Israeluüa tangbung khup rah kowi Josua kowi Gibeawnuüa uang phowng pe satang khai. Gibeawnuüa uang tek pe Josua mih, “Hungma mawngma süng hownia Amawruüa kowh manguüa amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi uang pawla now uang sen anging khai. Naiawng rakowi alenma uangah now uang lawng anging diah. Hauang nuata anging diah; uang tawi khowng anging diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Nami satang tata hanow Josua mih aia kowh siphai maten kowi pawla now Gilgal hownia lawt khai. Naiawngünuüa pungmadawng kowi Israeluüa kowh tasen lang kiak mih siphaiuüa paw uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, “Amawruüa kowi hangkow kram diah. Amatni kowi dow en rut kowi ang apta mih chowbowt. Amatni dow mapaw nanowng en kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Gilgal hownia lawt hanow uar prowt mang büah kung kowi Josua mih aia kowh siphaiuüa hown mingmang dowi khe Amawruüa kowh siphaiuüa kowi kowsenah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />CHAKRAMANG mih Amawruüa kowh siphai hawmh kowi mih Israeluüa pur kowi pe takrow takraiah khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih Gibeawn marow kowi Amawruüa kowh siphaiuüa kowi ahuma saita khai. Amatni kowi dow Bet-Hawrawn pra kowh awr pünla mih pangchowng iawng Israeluüa mih kawikrawiah khai. Amatni kowi dow Azeka hai Makeda marow kowi ting dowi mowr patiama rawng Israeluüa krawi saiah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Now Israeluüa pur kowi Bet-Hawrawn hownia powt kowh Azeka pra kowh tiasun kowi iu sun thüm khe amatni luk kowi mih mukuang hownia aiuk aiukma mih ria CHAKRAMANG iu pe klaah khai. Amatni dow Israeluüa hown tasen khe kowh kowng mih lak-e nami ria kuakah mih hown lang kowng hu khai.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Israeluüa rut kowi Amawruüa kowi CHAKRAMANG apta mih khin khe Israeluüa pur kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e Josua awr tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">“Aw CHAKRAMANG, sat kowi Gibeawn marow luk kowi pe iowngah hüah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:12">lama kowi dow Aijalawn lawngrawi luk kowi pe iowngah hüah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Naiawng rakowi ransu-uüa kowi Israeluüa nowngta dowi mowr dow sat mih Gibeawnuüa kowh marow luk kowi arasang iowng phülü khai, now lama paw Aijalawn lawngrawi luk kowi iowng phülü khai. Naiawng phaw mih lawnguan dow Jasar kowh bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai. Nakhowk khe sat mih kuang dawnglang kowi arasang uowi phülü khai. Nakow ni dow sat kup mih lang kra pani ngia chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Nami ni khe kowh lusa maru kowh laiklow iawng CHAKRAMANG chang mih nami dowi rawn hai nami kung kowi paw katpaw uowi dowi chekhai. Nami ni dow Israeluüa vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG dowk pe tasen khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Nami kung kowi Josua mih Israeluüa maten kowi pawla now Gilgal kowi kowh tangbung khup rah kowi kowplan khai.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawngphak pra kowh mang tanga ia kowi Josua kowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Amawruüa kowh mang tanga ia mih dow powt now Makeda marow re-e kowh puk uowi lowk mih kowi kowtapet khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Nachenganchepaw nakowi amatni tapet mih satang dow Josua tata khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Nami tata now Josua tek pe aia kowh siphaiuüa mih, “Nami puk plawt kowi hua aiukma kangowh mih kowlün pe sangrum diah, now towla pe achawng mih ne diah. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Tawkchedow nakowi mih hangkow uowi büah bowk diah; enni kowh ransu-uüa kowi kung hownia krawi senah büah reng diah. Amatni kowi dow amatni kowh marow prakowi enni nape powtah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih amatni kowi enni rut kowi apta enni mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Naiawng hown Josua hai Israeluüa dow Amawruüa kowh siphai hawmh kowi chumta ngia khai. Nachenganchepaw ia plai ne miuüa dow amatni kowh tap uowi mih marow lak kowi kowkup khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Nami kung kowi dow Israel siphai maten mih Makeda kowi kowh tangbung khup rah kowi thaulangma hown Josua tut-e uang plan khai bowt. Nami hownia bowt now Israeluüa kowi kingküala mih laiklow Kanan pren kowi kowh maru-uüa miapaw uam tek dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Now Josua tek pe aia kowh siphaiuüa mih, “Puk plawt mih kowuowah now paimi mang tanga ia kowi ang tut-e uang pawla büa diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowh siphaiuüa dow puk lak kowi kowh tapet mih mang tanga ia kowi uang lawtla now Josua tut-e uang pawla khai. Naiawngün manguüa dow Jerusalem marow mang, Hebrawn marow mang, Jarmut marow mang, Lakhis marow mang hai Eglawn marow mang chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Naiawngün manguüa kowi Josua tut-e Israel siphaiuüa uang pawla kung kowi Israeluüa maten kowi Josua hawah khai. Now aia hown kowh tawi tarü tasen mih siphai aluchowuüa kowi Josua tek pe mih, “Mami re-e uang büah now mami manguüa kowi uang nün pe ngawngtung büah madiah,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi siphai aluchowuüa dow nami manguüa kowi kownün pe ngawngtung khai.<verse eid="JOS 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi Josua tek pe mih, “Hangkow kram büah. Hangkow sak nen büah. Akürma hai sakkraingma uowiah büa diah. Enni nacham senah kown mih ransu-uüa maten kowi maiawng CHAKRAMANG nachangah reng kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Nami kung kowi dow Josua mih nami mang tanga ia kowi nasaita bowk hanow singh tanga klüng kowi natarta hüah kown mih aia maru-uüa kowi peah ana khai. Nami manguüa uak dow sat kup dowi mowr singh plawng kowi tatar hüah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Sat kup khowk khe dow Josua ana hown nami manguüa uak mih singh plawng hownia maru kowklaah khai, now amatni tapetla mih puk lak kowi kowkuakah khai. Now nami puk dow hua aiuk aiukma mih hown büngla khai. Naiawngün dow kawmat pat nakowi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mrawkphak pra kowh marow maten Josua krawi powng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Nami ni khe Josua mih Makeda marow dow powngta khai bowt. Nami marow kowi kowh mang hai sing uowi mih maru maten kowi dow aia saita bowk khai. Aia dow amia kowi paw asak pe plaiah dowi chekhai. Jeriko marow mang kowi aia changah iawng Makeda marow mang kowi paw aia changah khai.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Nami kung kowi dow Makeda marow hownia Israeluüa maten kowi Josua pawla now Libna marow prakowi tarü khai, now Libna marowchakuüa kowi kowsen büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />CHAKRAMANG mih nami marow hai nakowi kowh mang kowi dow Israeluüa rut kowi ap pe khai. Nami marow mang hai sing uowi mih maru maten kowi dow Josua saita bowk khai. Aia dow amia kowi paw asak pe plaiah dowi chekhai. Jeriko marow mang kowi aia changah iawng Libna marow mang kowi paw aia changah khai.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Nami kung kowi dow Libna hownia Israeluüa maten kowi Josua pawla now Lakhis marow prakowi tarü khai, now Lakhis marowchakuüa kowi kowsen büah khai. Amatni dow Lakhis marow kowi umta lut now senah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32-33" />CHAKRAMANG mih Lakhis marow kowi paw Israeluüa rut kowi ap pe khai. Nami marow dow pre ni kowh ni khe Josua powngta khai. Nami khin khe Gezer marow mang Horam mih Lakhis marow mang kowi uang tawi khowngah tasen chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni bowkbowk kowi Josua nowngta khai. Libna marow kowi iawng rowprowp Lakhis marow mang hailawm marowchakuüa maten kowi paw Josua saita bowk khai; mia kowi paw towah sing dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 10:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Nami kung kowi dow Lakhis hownia Israeluüa maten kowi Josua pawla now Eglawn marow prakowi kowtarü khai. Amatni dow Eglawn marow kowi umta lut now marowchakuüa kowi senah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Nami marow dow amatni senah kowh ni khe Josua hing powngta khai. Lakhis marow kowi iawng rowprowp Eglawn marow mang hailawm marowchakuüa maten kowi paw Josua saita bowk khai.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Nami kung kowi dow Eglawn hownia Israeluüa maten kowi Josua pawla now Hebrawn marow prakowi tarü khai, now nami marowchakuüa kowi senah büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />Amatni dow Hebrawn marow powngta now nakowi kowh mang hai maru maten kowi saita bowk khai. Nami klen kowi nami marow riaret kowi kowh kua kowi kowh maru maten paw saila bowk khai. Eglawn marow kowi iawng rowprowp Hebrawn marowchakuüa maten kowi paw Josua saita bowk khai; mia kowi paw towah sing dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Nami kung kowi dow Hebrawn hownia Israeluüa maten kowi Josua pawla kowh cham takuila now Debir marow prakowi tarü khai, now nami marowchakuüa kowi senah büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Amatni dow Debir marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten powngta now nakowi kowh mang hai maru maten kowi saita bowk khai. Libna hai Hebrawn marow kowi iawng rowprowp Debir marow hai mang kowi paw Josua saita bowk khai; mia kowi paw towah sing dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Naiawng hai Josua mih Kanan pren kowi kowh mrawkphak pra kowh süng maten krawi powngta bowk khai. Aia krawi powngah mih süng dow hungma mawngma süng ün, Negeb süng ün, awkaw hai rep ün chekhai. Aia dow naiawngün süng kowi kowh manguüa hai sing uowi mih maru maten kowi saita bowk khai; mia kowi paw towah sing dowi chekhai. Josua dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai ana pek iawng rowprowp naiawngün süng kowi kowh uowi miuüa luk kowi changah khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Josua dow Kades-Barnea marow hownia Gaza marow mowr, now Gawsen süng maten hownia Gibeawn marow mowr nowngta khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih amatni vüi kowi dowk pe tasen khai. Naiawng rakowi Josua dow cham dowk tasen mih pakat tarü sang mrawkphak pra kowh mang hai marow maten kowi nowngta khai. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa maten kowi Josua pawla now Gilgal kowi kowh amatni tangbung khup rah kowi kowplan khai bowt.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Tawngphak pra kowh manguüa kowi Israeluüa nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Akung kowi Hazawr marow mang Jabin dow Israeluüa cham awng mih lawnguan tawi ta khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi nakowsenah kownkow aia dow aia hown tatawn taret mih manguüa kowi krawi phowng pe satang khai. Naiawngün manguüa dow Madawn marow mang Jawbab, Simrawn marow mang hai Aksaf marow mang chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />Now tawngphak pra kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh manguüa, Galili sata mrawkphak pra kowh Jawrdan lawngrawi kowi kowh manguüa, awkaw kowi kowh manguüa hai satkup pra kowh Nafawt-Dawr pami arah kowi kowh manguüa kowi paw aia hawla khai. <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />Nami klen kowi nami satang dow satlawt pra hai satkup prakowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowh manguüa kowi, hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa, Hituüa, Perizuüa, Jebusuüa hai Hivuüa kowh manguüa tut-e paw aia phowngla pe khai. Hivuüa dow Hermawn hungh daw kowi kowh Mizpa pami arah kowi uowi mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Naiawngün manguüa dow amatni kowh siphai hawmh maten hown uang khai bowt. Amatni dow kawrnga hai <char style="w">kawrnga kari</char> paw ahuma uang pawla büah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow akawm krang mih sata pang kowi kowh sema nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Naiawngün mang maten dow amatni kowh siphai hawmh hown Merawm aw re-e takua talawm hanow khup tangbung büah khai. Now Israeluüa kowi senah kown mih lawnguan kowi sangkrang büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, “Kowbüah kowi hangkow kram diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tharau kowh maiawng khin khe amatni kowi ang nasaita bowk kown. Amatni kowh kawrnga maten kowi enni natüngta pe uowntüng sa kown, now kawrnga kari paw enni natowkta pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Naiawng rakowi Josua hai aia kowh siphai hawmh dow ransu-uüa uowi rah Merawm aw re-e kowkowi büah khai. Now ransu-uüa mingmang dowi khe amatni dow kowsenah khai. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa tut-e ransu-uüa kowi pe sumah khai. Now Israeluüa mih ransu-uüa kowi tawngphak prakowi dow Misrefat-Maim marow hai Sidawn marow mowr, now satlawt prakowi dow Mizpe lawngrawi mowr senla se kowkrawiah khai. Ransu-uüa kowng bowk dowi mowr Israel siphai hawmh dow ransu-uüa kowi krawi senah rereng khai. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp Josua mih ransu-uüa kowi changah khai. Aia dow amatni kowh kawrnga kowh uowntüng sa tüngta pe bowk khai, now kawrnga kari paw towkta pe bowk khai.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Nami khin khe akeng mih manguüa luk kowi kowh chang alow mih dow Hazawr marow mang chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Josua hai aia kowh siphai hawmh dow uang plan hanow Hazawr marow uang powngta khai, now nakowi kowh mang kowi saita büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Nami marow kowi kowh uowi mih maru maten kowi paw Israel siphai hawmh saila bowk khai. Nakowi dow lowk iachow paw ta sing dowi bowt chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow marow mih towkta büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Josua hai siphai hawmh dow naiawngün manguüa kowh marow maten powngta pe bowk khai. Now manguüa maten hai marowchakuüa maten kowi paw saita bowk khai. Josua hai aia kowh siphai hawmh dow CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi ana pek iawng rowprowp chang büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Nachenganchepaw piakta pakat kowh plan changah mih marow pungmadawng kowi Hazawr marow klen kowi lowkchow paw Josua hai aia kowh siphai hawmh towkla dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Naiawngün marow hownia dow Israel siphai hawmh mih amatni vüi uanh hai tawncher hawmh pawla büah khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi dow asaima saila bowk khai. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Nami dow Mosi ana pek iawng rowprowp Josua chang mih chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi dow naiawngün ana pek Josua kowi rik tekla pe khowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Mosi tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp Josua ta chang khai.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josua krawi powngah mih arah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Naiawng hai Josua hai aia kowh siphai hawmh dow paprenma powngta pe khai. Naiawngün dow tawngphak hai mrawkphak prakowi kowh hungma mawngma süng hai laina süng maten, Gawsen marow riaret kowi kowh uowi mih arah maten hai Jawrdan lawngrawi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17-18" />Amatni dow Seir hown atawnchow mih tawngphak pra kowh Halak Hungh hownia mrawkphak pra kowh Baal-Gad arah kowi kowh Lebanawn lawngrawi mowr krawi powngta khai. Nami lawngrawi dow Hermawn Hungh daw kowi chekhai. Josua dow naiawngün manguüa hown ning akrama dowk tasen kung kowi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="JOS 11:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Gibeawn marow kowi kowh uowi mih Hivuüa klen kowi dow mia iawng mih paw Israeluüa hown uang tatow taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm dowi chekhai. Akeng miuüa kowi dow Israel siphai hawmh mih nowngta bowk khai. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Naiawngün marowchakuüa kowh saktuak dow akhawtma CHAKRAMANG changta pe mih chekhai. Nami dow amatni kowi Israeluüa naia senah kownkow hai saksing sanara saktuak uowi dowi hown naia saiah kownkow chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng nachang kown mih Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG rik peta ana khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Nami khin khe Josua dow hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh uowi mih Anakuüa kowi paw kowsaita bowk khai. Naiawngün Anakuüa uowi mih dow Hebrawn, Debir, Anab, Juda hai Israeluüa uowiah mih süng maten kowi chekhai. Aia dow Anakuüa kowi hailawm amatni kowh marow maten asaima piakta pe bowk khai. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Israeluüa pren kowi dow lowk iachow paw Anakuüa ta sing dowi bowt chekhai. Tawkche Gaza marow, Gat marow hai Asdawd marow kowi dow Anakuüa ta sing uowi ne tak chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Mosi tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp Josua dow paprenma powngta khai. Now Israel krungchakuüa kowi dow amatni nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow nami pren mih aia krawi ret pe khai. Nami kung kowi dow pren mih <char style="w">thaulang</char> khai bowt.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s">Mosi tut-e sum mih manguüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Aia kowng dowi rawn khe Mosi mih Israeluüa hown Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi kowh mang pre ia kowi kowsenah khai, now amatchi kowh pren mih powngta pe khai. Amatni dow Arnawn lawngrawi hownia Hermawn hungh mowr powngta pe khai. Nami klen kowi Jawrdan lawngrawi satlawt prakowi kowh süng maten paw powngta pe bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Lowk kowi kowh Mosi hai Israeluüa senah mih dow Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun chekhai. Aia dow Hesbawn marow kowi kowh chowm mang mih chekhai. Aia kowh pren dow Arnawn lawngrawi re-e kowh Aroer marow hownia Jabawk aw mowr chekhai. Aia kowh pren sünghi dow nami Arnawn lawngrawi dawnglang hownia chekhai. Nami dow Amawnuüa kowh pren sünghi paw na chekhai. Naiawng hai Gileaduüa kowh süng dawnglang mang Sihun powngta khai; nami süng dow tawngphak prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi kowh Sihun powngah mih süng dow tawngphak pra kowh Galili sata hownia mrawkphak pra kowh Sata Kowng mowr chekhai. Nami klen kowi aia dow Bet-Jesimawt marow hai mrawkphak pra kowh Pisga hungh paw powngla khai.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Pre kowi kowh Mosi hai Israeluüa senah mih dow Basan pren mang Awk chekhai. Aia dow ta sing uowi mih Refaimuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lowk ia chekhai. Aia dow Astarte marow hai Edrei marow kowi kowh chowm mang mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Aia powngah mih pren rihi dow tawngphak prakowi kowh Hermawn hungh hai Saleka marow mowr chekhai, satlawt prakowi dow Basan pren paprenma chekhai, now satkup prakowi dow Gesuruüa hai Makauüa kowh rihi mowr chekhai. Nami klen kowi paw aia dow Gileaduüa kowh süng dawnglang powngta pe khai; nami süng dow mrawkphak prakowi chekhai. Nami re-e dow Hesbawn marow mang Sihun kowh pren sünghi paw na chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi hai Israeluüa dow nami mang pre ia kowi nowngta khai. Now amatni kowh pren dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten hai Manase krungchakuüa dawnglang kowi aia bak pe khai.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josua tut-e sum mih manguüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Josua hai Israeluüa mih Jawrdan aw satkup prakowi kowh manguüa kowi kowsenah khai, now amatni kowh pren mih kowpowngta pe khai. Amatni dow Lebanawn lawngrawi kowi kowh Baal-Gad pami arah hownia tawngphak pra kowh Halak hungh mowr powngta pe khai. Nami hungh dow Edawm pren hown atawnchow chekhai. Now naiawngün süng dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Israel krungchakuüa kowi Josua bak pe khai. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />Naiawngün süng dow hungma mawngma süng ün, satkup pra kowh laina ün, Jawrdan lawngrawi ün, hungh kowi kowh rep hai mrawkphak pra kowh süngrüp süngkangma ün chekhai. Naiawngün süng dow Hituüa, Amawruüa, Kananuüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa kowh uowi rah chekhai. Now naiawngün manguüa kowi dow Israeluüa senah hanow nowngta khai. <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Naiawngünuüa dow Jeriko marow mang, Bethel hown atawnchow mih Ai marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />Jerusalem marow mang, Hebrawn marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />Jarmut marow mang, Lakhis marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />Eglawn marow mang, Gezer marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />Debir marow mang, Geder marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />Hawrma marow mang, Arad marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />Libna marow mang, Adulam marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />Makeda marow mang, Bethel marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />Tapua marow mang, Hefer marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />Afek marow mang, Lasarawn marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />Madawn marow mang, Hazawr marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />Simrawn-Merawn marow mang, Aksaf marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />Tanak marow mang, Megido marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />Kedes marow mang, Karmel marow mang Jawkneam, <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />Nafawt-Dawr kowi kowh uowi mih Dawr marow mang, Gilgal kowi kowh uowi mih Goim marow mang, <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />now Tirza marow mang chekhai. Naiawngün manguüa dow bowkbowk kowi 31 ia chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa powngah dowi tak mih süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Josua dow lawngtang mih nowm khowk. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, “En kowh ning dow hu mih nowm khowk. Tawkche kawmat paw enni powngah kown mih süng uowi ahuma tak chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2-4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2-4" />Kawmat pat paw enni powngah dowi tak mih süng dow Filistinuüa kowh hai Gesuruüa kowh süng chekhai, now Kananuüa kowh aiukma mih süng chekhai (nami süng rihi dow Aigupta pren satlawt pra kowh Sihawr aw hownia tawngphak pra kowh Ekrawn marow rihi mowr chekhai). Nami klen kowi Filistinuüa kowh mang tanga ia kowh dow marow uowi chekhai (amatni kowh marow dow Gaza, Asdawd, Askelawn, Gat hai Ekrawn chekhai. Now mrawkphak prakowi uowi mih dow Avituüa kowh süng chekhai). Nami klen kowi tawngphak prakowi kowh paw enni nakrawi powngah kown mih süng uowi ahuma tak chekhai. Naiawngün dow Kanan pren powng kowi kowh Sidawnuüa krüa kowi uowi mih Meara marow hownia Amawruüa kowh pren sünghi Afek mowr chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 13:2-4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5-6" />Nami klen kowi Gebalituüa kowh süng paw enni powngah dowi tak chekhai. Satlawt pra kowh Hermawn hungh daw kowi uowi mih Baal-Gad marow hownia Lebo-Hamat marow mowr Lebanawn süng maten, now Lebanawn hownia Sidawn pren kowi kowh Misrefat-Maim mowr hungma mawngma süng maten paw enni powngah dowi tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 13:5-6">“Naiawngün süng kowi kowh uowi miuüa maten kowi dow Israeluüa pur hownia ang matia ngengche naprütta kown. Ang pe en ana khowk iawng mami pren dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Israeluüa kowi en naret pe kown. <verse eid="JOS 13:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />Naiawngün süng dow Israeluüa taku krungchak kowi hai Manase krungchak dawnglang kowi nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow en naret pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh powngta khowk mih süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten, now Manase krungchak dawnglang mih dow Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh süng nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow rik kata khowk chekhai. Naiawngün süng dow amatni vüi CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi khowm bowkla pe mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9-10" />Amatni kowh süng dow tawngphak pra kowh Arnawn lawngrawi ria kowi Aroer marow mowr chekhai; nami lawngrawi dawnglawng kowi kowh marow paw amatni kowh chekhai. Nami süng kowi taphang mih dow dowm nai chekhai; nami dowm nai dow Medeba marow hownia Dibawn marow mowr chekhai. Nami klen kowi Hesbawn marow kowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun powngah mih arah maten paw tawi taphang bowk khai. <verse eid="JOS 13:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />Nami klen kowi Gileaduüa kowh süng, Gesuruüa kowh süng, Makauüa kowh süng, Hermawn hungh hai Saleka mowr mih Basan pren süng maten, <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />now Basan pren mang Awk powngah mih süng maten paw tawi taphang khai. Mang Awk uowi mih dow Astarte marow hai Edrei marow kowi chekhai. Aia dow Refaimuüa pungmadawng kowi achur nowm nowm mih maru chekhai. Amatni kowi dow Mosi senah hanow amatni kowh pren mih powngta pe khai. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün Gesuruüa hai Makauüa kowi dow pren hownia Israeluüa prütta dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow ani mowr paw Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi reng tak.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Leviuüa kowh dawngthawnguan dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi maih kowi kowh tikah mih uanap kowi kowh uanh chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng naka kown mih amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG khamta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Levi krungchakuüa kowi dow Mosi retla pe dawngthawnguan dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reuben krungchakuüa kowh süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15-16" />Reuben krungchak kowh chuprek chaprekuüa kowi peah mih süng dow Arnawn lawngrawi ria kowi kowh Aroer marow iawng chekhai. Nami süng kowi taphang mih dow Medeba marow uowi mih dowm nai maten chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 13:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />Nami klen kowi Hesbawn marow hai dowm nai kowi kowh marow maten paw tawi taphang bowk khai. Naiawngün marow dow Dibawn, Bamawt-Baal, Bet-Baal-Meawn, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />Jahaz, Kedemawt, Mephat, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />Kiriathaim, Sibma, lawngrawi kowi uowi mih hungh luk kowi kowh Zeret-Sahar, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />Bet-Peur, Pisga rep hai Bet-Jesimawt ün chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />Reuben krungchak kowh süng dow dowm nai kowi kowh marow maten hai Hesbawn marow kowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun kowh pren ün chekhai. Mosi mih nami mang kowi hai Midianuüa kowh maru iukuüa kowi senah now kowngta bowk khai. Midianuüa kowh maru iukuüa dow Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur hai Reba büah chekhai. Amatni dow mang Sihun nimkrüa kowi naiawngün süng kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Naiawngünuüa klen kowi paw Beur kowh chapa hawra sara Balam kowi paw tasen khe Israeluüa saila khai.<verse eid="JOS 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Satkup pra kowh Reuben krungchak kowh süng rihi dow Jawrdan aw chekhai. Nami süng kowi kowh marow hai kua maten dow Reuben krungchakuüa kowh chuprek chaprekuüa nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gad krungchakuüa kowh süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24-25" />Gad krungchakuüa kowh chuprek chaprekuüa kowi Mosi peah mih süng kowi tawi taphang mih dow Jazer hai Gileaduüa kowh marow maten chekhai. Nami klen kowi Rabba re-e kowh Aroer marow mowr Amawnuüa kowh süng paw tawi taphang dawnglang chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 13:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />Nami klen kowi nakowi kowh tawi taphang mih dow Hesbawn marow hownia Ramat-Mizpe marow hai Betonim marow mowr chekhai, now Mahanaim marow hownia Debir marow mowr mih süng maten paw tawi taphang khai. <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />Nami klen kowi Jawrdan lawngrawi kowi kowh Bet-Haram marow, Bet-Nimra marow, Sukawt marow, Zafawn marow hai Hesbawn marow mang kowh akeng mih süng paw tawi taphang khai. Satkup pra kowh amatni kowh süng rihi dow Jawrdan aw hownia Galili sata pang mowr chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Naiawngün marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten dow Gad krungchakuüa kowh chuprek chaprekuüa nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa kowh süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29-30" />Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa kowh chuprek chaprekuüa kowi Mosi peah mih süng dow Mahanaim hownia Basan pren maten chekhai. Nami dow Basan mang Awk kowh süng kangowh chekhai. Nami süng kowi kowh 60 mih marow dow alai khe Jair kowh marow chowdiah. <verse eid="JOS 13:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />Nami klen kowi Gileaduüa süng dawnglang, Astarte hai Edrei marow paw tawi taphang chekhai. Basan pren mang Awk uowi mih dow nami marow pre buk kowi chekhai. Nami süng dow Manase krungchak dawnglang mih Makir chuprek chaprekuüa kowi Mosi peah mih chekhai. Makir dow Manase kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Jeriko marow satlawt pra kowh Moab pren dowm nai maten dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Mosi retla pe mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Nachenganchepaw Levi krungchakuüa kowi dow tawng iawng mih dawngthawnguan paw Mosi retla pe dowi. Amatni tut-e CHAKRAMANG khamah khowk iawng amatni kowh dawngthawnguan dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai chowtaih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Jawrdan aw satkup pra kowh krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Israeluüa mih Kanan pren kowi kowh krawng bawn ka büah khai bowt. Amatni kowi dow uamow Eleazar, Nun kowh chapa Josua hai Israel chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa mih bak pe khai. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2-5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2-5" />Amatni dow Mosi tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp Israel krungchakuüa kowi bak pe krawng bawn khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow krawng bawn bak lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG mih Mosi kowi rik tekla pe khowk chekhai. Mosi mih Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh krawng bawn Israel pre krungchak hown dawnglang kowi rik peta khowk. Manase krungchak dawnglang dow Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi tawi rik ka krawng bawn khowk chekhai; Manase hai Efraim dow Josef kowh chapa chekhai. Now Jawrdan aw satkup pra kowh krawng bawn dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Israel taku krungchak hown dawnglang mih ka büah khai bowt. Amatni kowi dow kuak pe plang hanow chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowi bak pe krawng bawn büah khai. Tawkche Levi krungchakuüa dow tawi ka krawng bawn dowi chekhai. Amatni tawi kaah mih marow hai kua dow amatni uowi rah vüi hai uanh towk rah krowngchow chekhai. Nami klen kowi amatni tawi kaah mih dowm dow chia hai ruapur thing müa vüi krowngchow chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 14:2-5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaleb lü Hebrawn marow mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Akat khe Juda krungchakuüa pungmadawng hownia Josua tut-e kowkowi sangrum khai. Naiawngünuüa pungmadawng kowi Keniz krungchak Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb paw tawi uowi chekhai. Nami khin khe Israeluüa uowi mih dow Gilgal pami arah kowi chekhai. Kaleb tek pe Josua mih, “Kades-Barnea marow kowi a-i uowi reng tak khe Thurai kowh maru Mosi tut-e en hai ang lawnguan kowi tawng chow CHAKRAMANG tekla mih en tuk. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Nakowkumü Kanan pren kownkow CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi mih Kades-Barnea marow hownia kowchin ang khai. Nami khin khe ang dow 40 ning chekhai. Now uang plan hanow ang khila mih maten achima ang uang lawp pe khai. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />Ang hown kowh tawi miuüa tarapdow maru-uüa kramla iawng mih laiklow uang tek pe büah khai. Nachenganchepaw ang dow kaah sakowm iawng CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai laiklow ang chün khai. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Naiawng rakowi nami ni khe takham se Mosi tek ang mih, ‘En dow kaah sakowm iawng CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai laiklow en chün khai. Naiawng rakowi enni krawi chawpah mih krawng bawn maten nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow en hai en kowh krungchakuüa kowi chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang peta enni khowk,’ pah ang khai.<verse eid="JOS 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />“Nami laikham dow 45 ning dowi rawn khe kowh Mosi kham ang mih chekhai. CHAKRAMANG dow aia kham ang iawng süngrüp süngkangma kowi a-i krawi len panglang mih khin khe hownia kawmat mowr pat pe sing ang khai. Now kawmat dow ang mih 85 ning chih khai bowt. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Mosi cham chin ang khe kowh iawng kawmat paw ang kowh kür uowi reng tak chekhai. Nakhowk khe kowh iawng kawmat paw ang kowh tasen kür uowi reng tak, now lowra lup chang kür paw uowi reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Naiawng rakowi ang tut-e CHAKRAMANG rik khamta khowk iawng hungma mawngma süng pe ang diah. Nami süng kowi dow Anakuüa uowi, now amatni kowh marow dow aiukma kangowh panow tap uowi bowk chekhai pami en ta khowk. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tawi uowila ang hanow aia tek iawng amatni kowi ang naia prütta kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Now Josua dow Kaleb kowi peah prasi khai, now nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Hebrawn marow mih Kaleb kowi aia peah khai. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Nami hownia kawmat pat paw Keniz krungchak Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb krungchakuüa dow nami marow kowi uowi reng tak chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Kaleb dow kaah sakowm iawng CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai laiklow chün khai. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />(Auown khe dow Hebrawn marow ming mih Kiriat-Arba chowdiah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Anakuüa pungmadawng kowi Arba pami kow iukma mih maru uowi lowk ia chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami marow ming dow nami maru ming iawng rükah mih chowdiah).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Nami kung kowi dow pren mih <char style="w">thaulang</char> khai bowt.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s">Juda krungchakuüa kowh süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Kuak pe plang kowh Juda krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn dow mrawkphak pra kowh Zin süngrüp süngkangma rihi mowr chekhai. Nami dow Edawmuüa kowh pren sünghi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2-3" />Mrawkphak pra kowh amatni kowh rihi uown dow Sata Kowng pang tawngphak pra hownia chekhai. Nami hownia mrawkphak pra kowh Akrabim pangchowng iawng panow Zin süngrüp süngkangma mowr, now nami hownia tawngphak pra kowh Kades-Barnea mowr kowtowm khai. Nami hownia Hezrawn marow iawng panow Addar marow mowr kowtowm khai, now nami hownia takui hanow Karka marow kowi kowtowm khai. <verse eid="JOS 15:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Nami hownia Azmawn mowr kowtowm khai. Now nami hownia Aiguptauüa kowh aw iawng panow Mediteranean sata kowi kowchur khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Satlawt pra kowh amatni kowh rihi dow Sata Kowng iawng panow Jawrdan aw uang mawr mih mowr chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 15:5">Tawngphak pra kowh amatni kowh rihi uown dow Sata Kowng kowi Jawrdan aw uang mawr mih hownia chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />Nami hownia Bet-Hawgla mowr kowtowm khai. Nami hownia tawngphak pra kowh Bet-Araba iawng panow Bohan kowh Hua mowr kowtowm khai. (Bohan dow Reuben kowh chapa chekhai). <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Nami hownia Akhawr lawngrawi iawng panow Debir mowr kowtowm khai. Nami hownia takui hanow Gilgal kowi kowtowm khai. Gilgal dow Adumim tiama kowi kowh lawngrawi tawngphak prakowi chekhai. Now Gilgal hownia En-Semes aw iawng panow En-Rogel mowr kowtowm khai. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Nami hownia Jerusalem marow mrawkphak pra kowh Hinawm lawngrawi mowr kowtowm khai. (Jerusalem dow Jebusuüa kowh marow chekhai). Nami marow iawng awr pün hanow Hinawm lawngrawi satkup pra kowh hungh mowr kowtowm khai. Nami hungh dow Refaim lawngrawi tawngphak prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Nami hungh hownia Neftaw aw kowi kowtowm khai. Nami hownia Efrawn hungh re-e kowh marow iawng panow Bala prakowi kowdowm khai. (Bala dow Kiriat-Jearim chekhai). <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />Nami hownia satkup prakowi takui hanow Seir hungh mowr kowtowm khai. Nami hownia Jearim hungh tawngphak pra iawng panow Bet-Semes kowi kowdowm khai. (Jearim hungh dow Kesalawn hungh chekhai). Nami hownia dow Timna mowr kowtowm khai. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Nami hownia Ekrawn marow tawngphak pra kowh hungh iawng panow Sikerawn prakowi takui khai. Nami hownia Bala hungh kowi kowtowm khai. Nami hownia Jabnel iawng panow Mediteranean sata kowi kowchur khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Satkup pra kowh amatni kowh rihi dow Mediteranean sata pang mowr chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 15:12">Mami dow Juda krungchakuüa kowh süng rihi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaleb kowh süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Josua mih CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb krungchakuüa kowi peah krawng bawn khai. Amatni kowi dow Juda krungchakuüa kowh süng pungmadawng kowi Kiriat-Arba marow aia peah khai. (Kiriat-Arba dow Hebrawn marow chekhai). Arba dow Anak kowh pa chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Kaleb mih Hebrawn marow hownia Anak krungchakuüa kowi prütta khai. Naiawngün dow Sesai, Ahiman hai Talmai büah chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Now Kaleb mih Debir marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi kowsenah khai. Auown khe Debir marow ming dow Kiriat-Sefer chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Kaleb tek mih, “Kownowng powng Kiriat-Sefer marow mih maru kowi dow ang kowh chama Aksa hown ang pe tachawngah kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Now Kaleb kowh tainau Kenaz chapa Awtniel mih Kiriat-Sefer marow kowpowngta khai. Naiawng rakowi Kaleb mih achama Aksa kowi Awtniel hown pe tachawngah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Amatchi tachawng mih ni khe a-pa hownia nakükla krawng bawn kownkow Awtniel mih amasi kowi tek pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Aksa dow a-pa tut-e kowkowi khai. Now kawrngaramchük hownia Aksa iu dowm khe a-pa Kaleb lüntaah mih, “Tum, tawng chow en nau?” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Aksa tek pe mih, “Apa, ang nau mih uowi pachap tak. Süngrüp süngkangma dow en peta ang khowk. Tawkche nakowi dow tui uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown pela ang tuikuam ne diah,” pape khai. Nahanow Aluk kowi kowh tuikuam hai Adak kowi kowh tuikuam mih Aksa kowi Kaleb peah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda krungchakuüa kowh marow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Maiawngün marow dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Juda krungchakuüa kowi peah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Amatni dow Edawm pren hown atawnchow mih süngrüp süngkangma mrawkphak pra kowh lang lah mih marow ün powngta khai. Naiawngün marow dow Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />Kina, Dimona, Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />Kedes, Hazawr, Itnan <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Zif, Telem, Bealawt, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />Hazawr-Hadatta, Keriawt-Hezrawn (nami dow Hazawr chekhai), <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amam, Sema, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />Hazar-Gada, Hesmawn, Bet-Pelet <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Hazar-Sual, Ber-Seba, Biziawthia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Bala, Im, Ezem, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Eltolad, Kesil, Hawrma, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Ziklak, Madmana, Sansana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Leba-Awt, Silhim, Ain hai Rimawn chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 29 klüng chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Laina satkup pra kowh Juda krungchakuüa kaah mih marow dow Estaawl, Zora, Asna, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Zanoa, Enganim, Tapua, Enam, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Jarmut, Adulam, Soko, Azeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Saraim, Aditaim, Gedera hai Gederawthaim chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 14 marow chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Laina tawngphak pra kowh amatni kaah mih marow dow Zenan, Hadasa, Migdal-Gad, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dilean, Mizpe, Jawkthel, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lakhis, Bawzkat, Eglawn, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Kabawn, Lamam, Kitlis, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Gederawt, Bet-Dagawn, Nama hai Makeda chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 16 marow chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Nami klen kowi laina süng dawnglang kowi kowh maiawngün marow paw kala bowk büah khai. Naiawngün marow dow Libna, Ether, Asan, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Ifta, Asna, Nezib, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keila, Akzib hai Maresa chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 9 marow chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Nami klen kowi Ekrawn marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten, <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />now Ekrawn satkup prakowi kowh Asdawd marow hai kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Nami klen kowi Asdawd marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai. Now Gaza marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai. Nami Gaza marow dow Aigupta pren sünghi kowi kowh awchawng hai Mediteranean sata pang kowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh amatni kaah mih marow maten dow Samir, Jatir, Soko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Dana, Kiriat-Sanna (Kiriat-Sanna dow Debir), <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anab, Estemua, Anim, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Gawsen, Hawlawn hai Gilawh chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 11 marow chekhai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw amatni kala khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Nami klen kowi kowh amatni kaah mih marow dow Arab, Duma, Esan, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Janim, Bet-Tapua, Apheka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Humta, Kiriat-Arba hai Ziawr chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 9 marow chekhai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Nami klen kowi kowh amatni kaah mih marow dow Maawn, Karmel, Zif, Juta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Jezrel, Jawkdeam, Zanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Kain, Gibeah hai Timna chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi hamüt marow chekhai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Nami klen kowi kowh amatni kaah mih marow dow Halhul, Bet-Zur, Gedawr, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Marat, Bet-Anawt hai Eltekawn chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 6 marow chekhai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Nami klen kowi Kiriat-Bal marow hai Rabba marow paw kala bowk büah khai. (Kiriat-Bal marow dow Kiriat-Jearim marow chekhai). Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala büah bowk khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh marow maten paw amatni kala bowk chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow Bet-Araba, Midin hai Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Nibsan, Awisa marow hai En-Gedi chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 6 marow chekhai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Nachenganchepaw Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi mih Jebusuüa kowi dow Juda krungchakuüa ia prütta dowi chekhai. Amatni dow kawmat paw Judauüa hown Jerusalem marow kowi tawi taiua uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="ms">Efraim hai Manase krungchakuüa kowh süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Kuak pe plang kowh tatawng mih iawng Josef chuprek chaprekuüa kaah mih süng dow Jeriko marow re-e kowh Jawrdan aw hownia Jeriko marow satlawt pra kowh tuikuam iawng chekhai. Now nami rihi dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng panow Bethel süng kowi kowh hungma mawngma süng prakowi awr pün khai. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Now Bethel hownia Luz kowi kowtowm khai, now Luz hownia Atarawt kowi kowh Arkiuüa süng kowi kowtowm khai. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Now satkup prakowi iu dowm now Jafletuüa süng kowi kowh Adak Bet-Hawrawn süng kowi kowdowh khai. Now nami hownia Gezer kowi kowtowm khai, now Mediteranean sata kowi kowchur khai.<verse eid="JOS 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Naiawngün süng dow Josef kowh chapa Manase hai Efraim krungchakuüa nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efraim krungchakuüa kowh süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5-6" />Efraim krungchak kowh chuprek chaprekuüa kowi peah mih süng dow maiawng: Satlawt pra kowh süng rihi dow Atarawt-Adar iawng panow aluk Bet-Hawrawn kowi kowtowm khai, now Mediteranean sata kowi kowchur khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 16:5-6">Now tawngphak pra kowh rihi dow Mikmethat hownia kowtakui hanow satlawt pra kowh Tanat-Silo iawng panow Janoah satlawt prakowi awr pün khai. <verse eid="JOS 16:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Janoah hownia kutplan dowm hanow Atarawt hai Nara iawng panow Jeriko sünghi ria mowr kowtowm khai, now Jawrdan aw kowi kowdowh khai. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Tawngphak pra kowh nami rihi dow Tapua hownia satkup pra kowh Kana awchawng iawng panow Mediteranean sata kowi kowchur khai. Naiawngün süng dow Efraim krungchakuüa kowh dawngthawnguan chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />Nami klen kowi paw Manase krungchakuüa kowh marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua ün Efraim krungchakuüa kowi pela ne tak chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Tawkche Gezer kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowi dow Efraimuüa prütta dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Gezer kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow kawmat paw Efraim krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi reng tak chekhai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow Efraim krungchakuüa changla nar khai.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s">Manase krungchakuüa kowh süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Nami kung kowi dow plan kuak pe plang hanow Manase krungchakuüa kowi ret pe krawng bawn khai. Manase dow Josef kowh chapa ta chekhai. Manase kowh chapa ta dow Makir chekhai. Makir dow Gilead kowh pa chekhai. Makir dow tasen akiakma rakowi Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi kowh Gilead hai Basan marow mih rik kata khai bowt. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Nachenganchepaw Manase krungchak kowi kowh akeng mih chuprek chaprekuüa kowi dow Jawrdan aw satkup prakowi Kanan pren kowi peah süng khai. Kanan pren kowi kowh ka süng miuüa dow Abiezer, Helek, Asriel, Sekem, Hefer hai Semida büah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Josef kowh chapa Manase krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Manase kowh chapa ming dow Makir, Makir kowh chapa dow Gilead, Gilead kowh chapa dow Hefer, now Hefer kowh chapa dow Zelofehad chekhai. Zelofehad kowh dow lowk ia paw chapa uowi dowi; chama kangowh chekhai. Aia kowh chamauüa ming dow Mala, Noa, Hawgla, Milka hai Tirza büah chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Naiawngün masiuüa mih uamow Eleazar, Nun kowh chapa Josua hai aluchowuüa tut-e kowkowiah now tek pe mih, “Anging kowh krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi anging kowi paw napela anging dawngthawnguan pabak kown mih Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana khai,” pakhai. Nami laiklow tata hanow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Josua mih nami masiuüa hawmh kowi amatni kowh pa kowh tainau-uüa pungmadawng kowi peah dawngthawnguan pabak khai. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Naiawng rakowi Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh Gilead hai Basan süng klen kowi satkup prakowi paw Manase krungchak dow ka süng hamüt bak tak chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Manase krungchakuüa kowh chapauüa hown naiawngün masiuüa hawmh paw tawi ka powng dawngthawnguan khai. (Manase kowh akeng mih krungchakuüa dow Gilead kowh süng ka khai).<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7-8" />Jawrdan aw satkup pra kowh Manase krungchakuüa kowh süng rihi dow Aser krungchakuüa kowh süng rihi mowr chekhai. Now amatni kowh mrawkphak pra kowh süng rihi dow Sekem re-e kowh Mikmethat hownia En-Tapua süng mowr chekhai. Nachenganchepaw En-Tapua marow dow Efraimuüa bak kowi taphang khai. <verse eid="JOS 17:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Now nami rihi dow tawngphak pra kowh Kana awchawng mowr kowdowh khai. Kana awchawng mrawkphak pra kowh Manase krungchakuüa süng kowi dow marow uowi sangrum chowdiah. Tawkche naiawngün marow dow Efraimuüa kowh marow chekhai. Manase krungchak kowh rihi dow Kana awchawng mrawkphak pra iawng panow Mediteranean sata kowi kowchur khai. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Kana awchawng mrawkphak pra kowh süng dow Efraimuüa kowh chekhai, now tawngphak pra kowh süng dow Manase krungchakuüa kowh chekhai. Satkup pra kowh Manase krungchakuüa kowh süng rihi dow Mediteranean sata mowr chekhai. Now tawngphak pra kowh rihi dow Aser krungchakuüa kowh sünghi mowr, now satlawt pra kowh rihi dow Isakar krungchakuüa kowh sünghi mowr chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Isakar krungchak hai Aser krungchak süng kowi kowh Bet-San marow, Ibleam marow hai aria aret kowi kowh uowi mih kua maten dow Manase krungchakuüa kowi peah khai. Nami klen kowi Dawr (Dawr pami kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Nafat chekhai), Endawr, Tanak hai Megido kowi kowh maru hailawm marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten paw Manase krungchak kowi peah khai.<verse eid="JOS 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Tawkchedow naiawngün marow maten mih Manase krungchakuüa krawi ia powngta bowk dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa dow naiawngün süng hownia powt kown nau dowi kowh hing tatang chen khai. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa uang kür ngamlam mih khin khe amatni kowi dow Israeluüa changla nar khai. Amatni kowi dow Israeluüa mih pren hownia prütta bowk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josef krungchakuüa lü süng küng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Josef krungchakuüa mih Josua tut-e kowkowiah now kowtek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow nachangla dawngthawnguan kown mih süng arahchow en tuk pe anging khai? CHAKRAMANG pe anging prasi rakowi anging paw maru iun akawmma khowk lowmow,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Nakhowk khe Josua hawt tek pe mih, “Enni kowh maru iun kawm lai rakowi Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng paw enni che talawk dowi bowt hanow Perizuüa hai Refaimuüa pren kowi kowh singh rüm krawngta chia büa diah, now naiawngün dow hing powngta büah towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Nakhowk khe Josef krungchakuüa tek pe Josua mih, “Hungma mawngma süng dow anging talawk dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw dowm kowi kowh uowi mih Bet-San marow kowi kowh uowi mih, aria aret kowi kowh kua kowi uowi mih hai Jezrel lawngrawi kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowi anging nowng sen dowi tham. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh dow lawngha hown kowh kawrnga kari uowi bowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Nakhowk khe Josef kowh chapa Efraim hai Manase krungchakuüa kowi Josua plan tek pe iawk mih, “Enni kowh dow maru iun akawmma, now kür paw akürma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi süng pabakchow nak dowi enni naka kown. <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />Kaurawng kangowh mih hungma mawngma süng paw enni naka kown. Naiawngün süng dow enni nachiaah kown takla. Nahanow naiawngün kaurawng hai süng maten enni nahing powngta kown. Kananuüa kowh lawngha hown kowh kawrnga kari uowi chepaw, now amatni akürma chepaw amatni kowi mih enni naprütta kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s">Akeng mih krungchakuüa kowi ret pe krawng bawn mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1-2" />Kanan pren ki powngta bowk kung kowi Israeluüa mih Silo marow kowi arasang takua talawm khai, now khup <char style="w">taklowp taklangra te</char> büah khai. Kanan pren maten amatni krawi powngta bowk khowk chepaw ranit krungchak mih dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow tawi ka krawng bawn dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 18:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Naiawng rakowi Josua tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Kanan pren dow CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai peta enni khowk. Tawng khe chiang chow nami pren kowi kowh krawng bawn enni nakrawi powng kown? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Enni ranit krungchak hownia pakrungchak kowi sum ia chi rui maru diah. Now paprenma kowi kowh krawng bawn nakrawi mü kownkow amatni kowi ang nachinah kown. Amatni dow nakrawi müla kaneu hanow nami süng tawng iawng chow naia tabak kown mih lawnguan kowi nauang ruila kown, now ang tut-e nauang pawla büah kown. Nahanow amatni krungchakuüa kowi ang naret pe krawng bawn kown. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5-6" />Kanan pren kowi kowh bakah dowi tak mih krawng bawn kowi enni nachangah ranit bak kown. Nami ranit bak mih krawng bawn lawnguan kowi enni nauang ruila kaneu kown. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai pur kowi enni vüi ang nakuak plang kown. Tawkche Juda krungchak hai Josef krungchak dow nami ranit bak mih natawi ka kown nadowi bowt. Juda krungchakuüa dow mrawkphak pra kowh amatni kowh krawng bawn kowi nauowi kown, now Josef krungchakuüa dow tawngphak pra kowh amatni kowh krawng bawn kowi nauowi büah kown.<verse eid="JOS 18:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />“Nachenganchepaw Leviuüa dow enni iawng natawi ka krawng bawn kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chang uamow lup mih chekhai. Amatni kowh dawngthawnguan dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi chang uamow lup mih towbowt. Now Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchakuüa maten hai Manase krungchakuüa dawnglang mih dow Jawrdan aw satlawt pra pown kowi rik kata krawng bawn khowk. Amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi retla pe khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Nakowkrawi mü krawng bawn kownkow lang ruiah miuüa tarü mih khin khe Josua krawi tek pe mih, “Kanan pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi krawi kowi büa hanow krawi müla kaneu büa diah. Now krawng bawn lawnguan uang ruila büah. Nami enni uang ruila mih dow mami Silo marow kowi ang tut-e uang pawla büa diah. Now enni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa naia ka krawng bawn kownkow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi ang nakuak enni plang kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Naiawng rakowi naiawngün maru-uüa dow pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi krawi kowi khai. Amatni dow pren kowi kowh krawng bawn mih changah ranit bak khai. Now pabak pabak kowi kowh marow, kua hai süng tawng iawng chow naia tabak kown mih lawnguan kowi uang ruila büah bowk khai. Nami kung kowi dow Silo marow kowi kowh amatni kowh tangbung khup rah kowi Josua tut-e uang plan büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Nahanow Josua dow Israeluüa vüi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kuak pe plang khai, now amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowi bak pe krawng bawn khai.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Benjamin krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Kuak plang hanow Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh ming dow uang rik tatüng khai. Amatni krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn dow Juda krungchakuüa hai Josef krungchakuüa takra kowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Tawngphak pra kowh amatni kowh rihi dow Jawrdan aw iawng panow Jeriko marow tawngphak pra kowh rep mowr, now nami hownia satkup pra kowh hungma mawngma süng iawng panow Bet-Aven pami süngrüp süngkangma mowr kowtowm khai. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Nami hownia Luz mrawkphak pra kowh rep iawng panow Atarawt-Adar pami arah kowi kowdowh khai. (Luz dow Bethel chekhai). Atarawt-Adar uowi mih dow Adak Bet-Hawrawn mrawkphak pra kowh hungh luk kowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Nami kung kowi dow Bet-Hawrawn mrawkphak pra kowh hungh hownia satkup prakowi iu takui now mrawkphak pra kowh Kiriat-Bal kowi kowtowm khai. Kiriat-Bal dow Kiriat-Jearim chekhai. (Kiriat-Jearim dow Juda krungchakuüa kowh marow chekhai). Mami dow Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh satkup pra kowh rihi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Mrawkphak pra kowh amatni kowh rihi dow satlawt pra kowh Kiriat-Jearim hownia satkup pra kowh Neftaw aw mowr chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Nami kung kowi dow nami rihi mih Ben-Hinawm lawngrawi pur kowi kowh hungh tut kowi kowdowh khai. Nami lawngrawi dow Refaimuüa süng kowi kowh lawngrawi mrawkphak prakowi chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Ben-Hinawm lawngrawi iawng panow Jebusuüa kowh marow tawngphak pra kowh rep rowkrowk iu dowm now En-Rogel mowr kowting khai. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Nami kung kowi dow nami rihi mih tawngphak prakowi kowtakui hanow En-Semes iawng panow Adumim prakowi pangchowng pur kowi Gelilawt kowi awr pün khai. Nami hownia iu dowm hanow Reuben kowh chapa Bohan kowh huamang mowr kowting khai. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Nami kung kowi dow nami hownia Bet-Araba tawngphak pra kowh rep iawng panow Jawrdan lawngrawi kowi kowdowm khai. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Nami kung kowi dow nami rihi mih Bet-Hawgla tawngphak pra kowh rep iawng panow Sata Kowng tawngphak pra kowh sata prek kowi kowchur khai. Jawrdan aw kowmawr mih dow nami sata prek kowi chekhai. Mami dow Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh mrawkphak pra kowh süng rihi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Satlawt pra kowh amatni kowh rihi dow Jawrdan aw chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 18:20">Maiawngün dow Benjamin krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn rihi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Benjamin krungchakuüa kaah mih marow dow Jeriko, Bet-Hawgla, Emek-Keziz, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Bet-Araba, Zemaraim, Bethel, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Avim, Para, Ofra, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Chephar-Amoni, Ofni hai Geba chekhai. Maiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 12 buk chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Nami klen kowi kowh amatni kaah mih marow dow Gibeawn, Rama, Berawt, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Mizpe, Chephira, Moza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Rekem, Irpel, Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Zela, Ha-Elef, Jebusuüa kowh Jerusalem marow, Gibeah hai Kiriat-Jearim chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi laitali klüng chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s">Simiawn krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Pre kat kowi kowh kuak plang khe dow Simiawn krungchakuüa kowh ming uang tatüng khai, now amatni kowi mih ret pe krawng bawn khai. Amatni kowi kowh peah mih krawng bawn dow Juda krungchakuüa kowh süng kowi tawi taphang khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2-6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2-6" />Simiawn krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn kowi kowh marow dow Ber-Seba, Molada, Hazar-Sual, Bala, Ezem, Eltolad, Bethul, Hawrma, Ziklak, Bet-Markabawt, Hazar-Susa, Bet-Lebawt hai Saruhen chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi 13 buk chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 19:2-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7-8" />Nami klen kowi Ain, Rimawn, Ether hai Asan marow paw Simiawn krungchakuüa kala khai. Nami marow tali klüng hai Negeb kowi kowh Rama marow mowr aria aret kowi kowh kua maten paw Simiawn krungchakuüa kala khai. Naiawngün dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Simiawn krungchakuüa kaah mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 19:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Naiawngün krawng bawn dow Juda krungchakuüa kowh krawng bawn hownia Simiawn krungchakuüa tawi pawah mih chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Juda krungchakuüa dow amatni lakkeah mih lak-e achütma ka krawng bawn khai.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zebulun krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Sum kat kowi kowh kuak plang khe dow Zebulun krungchak ming uang tatüng khai, now amatni kowi mih ret pe krawng bawn khai. Amatni kowi kowh peah mih krawng bawn rihi dow Sarid marow hownia uownah khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Satkup pra kowh rihi dow Sarid hownia Marala marow mowr, now nami hownia Dabeset marow iawng panow Jawkneam marow re-e kowh aw kowi kowchur khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Now satlawt pra kowh rihi dow Sarid hownia awr takui hanow Kislawt-Tabawr marow kowi kowtowm khai. Nami hownia Daberat marow iawng panow Jafia marow kowi kowpün khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Nami hownia dow Gat-Hepher marow iawng panow Et-Kazin marow mowr kowting khai. Nami kung kowi dow Neah marow prakowi kowtakui now Rimawn marow kowi kowtowm khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Rimawn hownia tawngphak prakowi kowtakui now Hanathawn marow kowi kowtowm khai, now Iptahel lawngrawi kowi kowchur khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Zebulun süng kowi kowh marow pungmadawng kowi dow Katat, Nahalal, Simrawn, Idala hai Bethlehem marow paw tawi taphang khai. Amatni kaah mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi 12 marow chekhai, now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Naiawngün marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Zebulun krungchakuüa kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isakar krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Tali kat kowi kowh kuak plang khe dow Isakar krungchakuüa kowh ming uang tatüng khai, now amatni kowi mih ret pe krawng bawn khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Amatni kaah mih süng kowi tawi taphang mih marow dow Jezrel, Kesulawt, Sunem, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Hapharaim, Siawn, Anaharat, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Rabit, Kisiawn, Ebez, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Remet, Enganim, En-Hada hai Bet-Pazez chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Amatni kowh süng rihi dow Tabawr, Sahazuma, Bet-Semes marow iawng panow Jawrdan aw kowi kowchur khai. Amatni kowh süng kowi tawi taphang mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi 16 marow chekhai, now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Naiawngün marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Isakar krungchakuüa kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aser krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Tanga kat kowi kowh kuak plang khe dow Aser krungchakuüa kowh ming uang tatüng khai, now amatni kowi mih ret pe krawng bawn khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Amatni kaah mih süng kowi tawi taphang mih marow dow Helkat, Hali, Beten, Aksaf, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Alamelek, Amad hai Misal chekhai. Satkup pra amatni kowh rihi dow Karmel hungh hai Sihawr-Libnat marow mowr chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Now nami hownia satlawt prakowi awr takui hanow Bet-Dagawn kowi kowtowm khai. Nami hownia Zebulun krungchakuüa kowh süng hai Iptahel lawngrawi iawng panow Kabul marow lakuai pra towla kowh tawngphak pra kowh Bet-Emek hai Neiel marow mowr kowting khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Nami hownia tawngphak pra kowh Abdawn, Rehawb, Hamawn hai Kana marow iawng panow Sidawn marow kri mowr kowtowm khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29-30" />Nami kung kowi dow Rama marow prakowi kowtakui now tap uowi mih Tura marow kowi kowtowk khai. Nami kung kowi dow nami hownia Hosa prakowi kowtakui now Mediteranean sata kowi kowdowh khai. Amatni kowh süng kowi dow Mahalab, Akzib, Umma, Afek hai Rehawb marow paw tawi taphang khai. Aser krungchakuüa süng kowi tawi taphang mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi 22 marow chekhai, now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 19:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Naiawngün marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Aser krungchakuüa kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naptali krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Taruk kat kowi kowh kuak plang khe dow Naptali krungchakuüa kowh ming uang tatüng khai, now amatni kowi mih ret pe krawng bawn khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Amatni kowh süng rihi dow Helef hownia uownah now Zananim kowi kowh sasua singh mowr kowting khai. Nami hownia dow Adami-Nekeb hai Jabnel marow iawng panow Lakum marow kowi kowtowm khai, now Jawrdan aw kowi kowchur khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Nami kung kowi dow nami rihi mih satkup prakowi iu takui kowh Aznawt-Tabawr iawng panow Hukawk marow kowi kowtowk khai. Now mrawkphak pra amatni kowh rihi dow Zebulun krungchak rihi mowr, satkup prakowi dow Aser krungchak rihi mowr, now satlawt prakowi dow Jawrdan aw re-e kowh Juda krungchak rihi mowr chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Amatni kaah mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi 19 marow chekhai, now marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw kala bowk büah khai. Naiawngün pungmadawng kowi tap uowi mih marow dow Zidim, Zer, Hamat, Rakat, Kineret, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Adam, Rama, Hazawr, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kedes, Edrei, En-Hakawre, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Irawn, Migdalel, Horem, Bet-Anat hai Bet-Semes chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Naiawngün marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Naptali krungchakuüa kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dan krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Ranit kat kowi kowh kuak plang khe dow Dan krungchakuüa kowh ming uang tatüng khai, now amatni kowi dow ret pe krawng bawn khai. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Amatni kaah mih süng kowi tawi taphang mih marow dow Zora, Estaawl, Irsemes, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Salabim, Aijalawn, Itla, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Elawn, Timna, Ekrawn, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Elteke, Gibethawn, Baalat, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Jehud, Bene-Berak, Gat-Rimawn, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Mejarkawn, Rakawn Jopa pur kowi kowh süng ün chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47-48" />Naiawngün marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Dan krungchakuüa kaah mih chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Dan krungchakuüa vüi bak kowi kowh krawng bawn dow ransu-uüa uang khünta pe ne khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Lais marowchakuüa kowi kowsenah now kowsaita bowk büah khai, now nami marow dow powngta büah khai. Nami kung kowi amatni dow Lais marow kowi uowi büah khai, now amatni kowh pipu-uüa ming iawng nami marow kowi Dan marow pahai plan chap pe ming khai.<verse eid="JOS 19:47-48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josua kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49-50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49-50" />Pren mih ki tabakta büah bowk hanow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Nun kowh chapa Josua kowi paw nami pren kowi Israeluüa retla pe krawng bawn khai. Amatni dow aia lüah iawng Timnat-Sera marow mih Josua kowi peah khai. Nami marow dow Efraim krungchakuüa kowh krawng bawn pungmadawng kowi kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi chekhai. Nami marow mih asar plan thawpah hanow nakowi mih Josua uowi khai.<verse eid="JOS 19:49-50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Naiawng hown uamow Eleazar, Nun kowh chapa Josua hai Israel krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa maten mih Silo marow kowi Israeluüa kowi ret pe krawng bawn khai. Amatni dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e kuak pe plang hanow Israeluüa kowi ret pe krawng bawn khai. Naiawng hown amatni taret krawng bawn mih dow chur khai.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s">Tatung tanimra marow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Josua mih, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />“Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Mosi kowi ang peah mih ana iawng tatung tanimra marow lang rui büah ne diah. <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />Lowra maru saita kown mih saktuak uowi dowi kowi rut tawi khawk tawi kowh saita maru khai hanow nami maru mih naiawngün marow kowi naia powt kown. Nahanow aia dow lu klai pawk mih maru hownia naplai kown. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Aia kowpowtah mih tatung tanimra marow kowi aia kowtowm mih khin khe aia mih marow tapplawt re-e naiowng kown. Now nakowi kowh uowi mih lawngtang aluchowuüa tut-e aia kowh lawnguan maten nalawp pe kown. Nami kung kowi dow lawngtang aluchowuüa mih amatni kowh marow kowi aia kowi nape kupah kown. Now aia kowi dow napeah uowi rah parah kown. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Now lu klai pawk mih che kowngta maru mih kung uang kawikrawi khai hanow kowngta maru mih kowi dow lu klai pawk mih maru rut kowi lawngtang aluchowuüa mih naap-ah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow saita kown mih saktuak uowi dowi kowi rut tawi khawk tawi kowh kowngta mih chowtaih. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Tara chetra kowi chet pe tara dowi mowr, now nami khin khe kowh uamow lang kri mih kowng dowi mowr aia dow tatung tanimra marow kowi nauowi kown takla. Nami kung kowi aia dow amatni kowh marow kowi hai aiamat kim kowi naia plan kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow Jawrdan aw satkup prakowi tatung tanimra marow lang kraah sum buk khai. Naiawngün marow dow Naptali krungchakuüa kowh Galili kowi kowh Kedes marow, Efraim krungchakuüa kowh Sekem marow hai Juda krungchakuüa kowh Kiriat-Arba marow chekhai. (Kiriat-Arba marow dow Hebrawn marow chekhai). Naiawngün marow sum buk mih dow hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Now amatni dow Jeriko marow hown tatang dowk mih Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi paw tatung tanimra marow lang kraah sum buk khai. Naiawngün marow dow Reuben krungchakuüa kowh anaima mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Bezer marow, Gad krungchakuüa kowh Gilead kowi kowh Ramawt marow hai Manase krungchakuüa kowh Basan kowi kowh Golan marow chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Israeluüa chepaw, amatni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa chepaw kowngta kown mih saktuak uowi dowi kowi rut tawi khawk tawi kowh cham saita maru khai hanow nami maru dow naiawngün khowmta bowkta mih tatung tanimra marow kowi naia powt kown. Aia kowi dow tara chetra kowi chetah dowi mowr lu klai pawk mih maru naia saita kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="ms">Leviuüa vüi bak kowi kowh marow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1-2" />Kanan pren kowi kowh Silo marow kowi amatni uowi reng tak khe Levi chenchap<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1-2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Levi chenchap </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Levi kowh chapa sum ia Kohat, Gersawn hai Merari büah kowi tekah mih chekhai.</char></note> kowi kowh aluchowuüa mih uamow Eleazar, Nun kowh chapa Josua hai Israel chenchap kowi kowh aluchowuüa tut-e kowkowi khai. Now tek pe büah mih, “Anging vüi uowi rah hai tawncher thing rah süng nape anging kown mih lawnguan kowi Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih Mosi tekla enni khowk. Naiawng rakowi marow hai marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng pe anging diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 21:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng chang khai. Amatni dow amatni kaah mih dawngthawnguan hownia marow hai marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng Leviuüa kowi pela ne khai.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Kuak plang hanow Kohat krungchakuüa ming uang rik tatüng khai. Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi uamow Arawn kowh krungchakuüa dow Juda krungchak, Simiawn krungchak hai Benjamin krungchak kowh süng hownia ka marow laisum buk khai. Arawn dow Kohat krungchak maru chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Now Kohat krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh akeng mih machakuüa dow Efraim krungchak, Dan krungchak hai Manase krungchak dawnglang mih hownia ka marow hamüt klüng khai.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Plan kuak plang hanow Gersawn krungchakuüa ming uang tatüng khai. Amatni dow Isakar krungchak, Aser krungchak, Naptali krungchak hai Basan pren kowi kowh Manase krungchak dawnglang mih hownia ka marow laisum buk khai.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Now Merari krungchakuüa dow Reuben krungchak, Gad krungchak hai Zebulun krungchak hownia ka marow laipre buk khai.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Mosi tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Israeluüa mih kuak pe plang hanow naiawngün marow hai marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng Leviuüa kowi peah khai.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kohat krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9-10" />Levi chenchap Kohat krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kuak plang hanow Arawn krungchakuüa ming uang tatüng khai. Amatni dow Juda krungchak hai Simiawn krungchakuüa kowh süng hownia ka marow sangrum chi khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Juda krungchak hownia kowh amatni kaah mih dow hungma mawngma süng kowi Kiriat-Arba (Hebrawn) marow hai aria aret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng krowngchow chekhai. Arba dow Anakuüa kowi prekche miia chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Tawkche Kiriat-Arba kowi kowh kua ün hai süng ün dow Jefune chapa Kaleb kowi rik peta khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13-16" />Arawn krungchakuüa kowi dow Hebrawn, Libna, Jatir, Estemua, Hawlawn, Debir, Ain, Juta hai Bet-Semes marow peah khai. Naiawngün marow dow bowkbowk kowi taku marow chekhai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng maten dow pela bowk büah khai. Naiawngün marow maten hownia Hebrawn marow dow changla tatung tanimra marow khai. Naiawngün marow dow Juda krungchak hai Simiawn krungchak hownia kowh amatni kaah mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 21:13-16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17-18" />Nami klen kowi Benjamin krungchak hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali marow dow Gibeawn, Geba, Anathawt hai Almawn chekhai. Naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Uamow Arawn krungchakuüa kaah mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi laisum buk chekhai. Naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Levi chenchap Kohat krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh Arawn machakuüa klen kowi akeng mih krungchakuüa dow Efraim krungchakuüa kowh süng hownia ka marow sangrum khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21-22" />Efraim krungchakuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh amatni kaah mih tali marow dow Sekem, Gezer, Kibzaim hai Bet-Hawrawn chekhai. Naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. Naiawngün marow maten hownia Sekem marow dow changla tatung tanimra marow khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:21-22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23-24" />Nami klen kowi Dan krungchakuüa süng hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali marow dow Elteke, Gibethawn, Aijalawn hai Gat-Rimawn chekhai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Manase krungchak dawnglang mih hownia kowh amatni kaah mih pre buk mih marow dow Tanak hai Gat-rimawn chekhai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Kohat krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh akeng mih krungchakuüa kaah mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi hamüt marow chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gersawn krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Levi chenchap Gersawn krungchakuüa dow Basan pren kowi kowh Golan marow hai Bestera marow Manase krungchak dawnglang mih hownia ka pre buk khai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. Naiawngün marow hownia Golan marow dow changla tatung tanimra marow khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28-29" />Nami klen kowi Isakar krungchakuüa süng hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali marow dow Kisiawn, Daberat, Jarmut hai Enganim chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:28-29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30-31" />Now Aser krungchakuüa süng hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali marow dow Misal, Abdawn, Helkat hai Rehawb chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Naptali krungchakuüa süng hownia kowh amatni kaah mih sum buk mih marow dow Galili kowi kowh Kedes, Hamawt-Dawr hai Kartan chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala büah khai. Naiawngün marow hownia Kades marow dow changla tatung tanimra marow khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Gersawn krungchakuüa kaah mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi laisum buk chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Merari krungchakuüa kaah mih krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34-35" />Levi chenchap Merari krungchakuüa dow Zebulun krungchakuüa kowh süng hownia ka marow tali klüng chekhai. Naiawngün marow dow Jawkneam, Karta, Dimna hai Nahalal chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:34-35" /><verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36-37" />Nami klen kowi Reuben krungchakuüa hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali marow dow Bezer, Jahaz, Kedemawt hai Mephat chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:36-37" /><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38-39" />Gad krungchakuüa hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali marow dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Ramawt, Mahanaim, Hesbawn hai Jazer chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. Naiawngün marow hownia Ramawt marow dow changla tatung tanimra marow khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Levi chenchap Merari krungchakuüa kaah mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi laipre buk chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Israeluüa kaah mih süng hownia Leviuüa kaah mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi 48 marow chekhai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Naiawngün marow maten aria aret kowi tawncher thing rah süng uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa krawi nowng powngta pren mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa kowi napeah pren kownkow amatni pipu-uüa tut-e takham khai. Now aia takhamta mih powm iawng CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa kowi peah khai. Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG khamah mih pren maten krawi powngta hanow nakowi mih uowi büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Amatni pipu-uüa tut-e kowh takhamta iawng CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa kowi tasenra maten hownia pe tanaiah khai bowt. Mia iawng mih ransu-uüa paw amatni pur kowi nowng iowng dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa rut kowi amatni kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi dow CHAKRAMANG appe khai. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Israeluüa kowi nachangah aiung kown pahai aia takhamta mih maten CHAKRAMANG mih chang pe khai; aia takhamta iawng chang pe dowi mih lowk paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s">Satlawt pra kowh Israeluüa plan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Nami kung kowi dow Josua mih Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten, now Manase krungchakuüa dawnglang mih kowi hawah khai. <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />Now aia tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi pe enni mih ana maten enni chün khai. Nami klen kowi ang laiklow maten paw enni chün khai. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi enni tawi uowila mih akrama khowk; kawmat pat paw enni powtta dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih ana maten kaneuma enni chünah khai. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih aia takhamta iawng enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi tasenra hownia pe tanaiah khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi khaleng dow CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi pela enni mih Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh süng kowi plan büah towbowt. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi pela enni mih ana hai ari aiang mih kaneuma chünah büa diah: CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi sakrauah büa diah, aia tiama maten kowi mangah büa diah, aia kowh ana pek maten chünah büa diah, aia kaah sakowm iawng uowi büa diah, now enni kowh sak maiow hai saktuak maiow hown aia kowh lup changah büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6-8" />Mosi mih Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa kowi dow Basan pren peah khai. Now ta lat dawnglang miuüa kowi dow Jawrdan aw satkup pra kowh süng Josua peah khai. Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh süng kowi plan miuüa kowi Josua tek pe mih, “Enni kowh dow dawngthawnguan ahuma chekhai. Enni kowh dow tawncher hawmh ün, kuh ün, tai ün, kri ün, lawngha hai tawnguat ün ahuma chekhai. Naiawngün pawla now kawmat dow kim prakowi mang büa diah. Enni kowh ransu-uüa hownia kowh rupah mih naiawngün dawngthawnguan dow enni kowh tainau-uüa hown taretah büa diah,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow Josua mih amatni kowi peah prasi hanow pe mangah khai. Nahanow amatni dow amatni kowh kim kowi plan mang khai bowt.<verse eid="JOS 22:6-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Naiawng hown Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten, now Manase krungchakuüa dawnglang dow Kanan pren kowi kowh Silo marow kowi Israeluüa hown taprai khai bowt. Now amatni dow Gilead süng prakowi plan mang büah khai bowt. Nami süng dow Mosi tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng amatni kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satlawt pra kowh Israeluüa thawp phuchuara mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten, now Manase krungchakuüa dawnglang dow Gelilawt marow kowi kowtowm büah khai. Nami marow dow Kanan pren sünghi kowi kowh Jawrdan aw re-e chekhai. Now nakowi dow amatni mih phuchuara aiukma thawp büah lowk khai. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Kanan pren sünghi kowi kowh Gelilawt marow kowi Jawrdan aw re-e Reuben hai Gad krungchakuüa maten, now Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa thawp phuchuara mih satang dow akeng mih Israeluüa ta khai. <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Nami satang ta hanow akeng mih Israeluüa dow nakowsen kowbüah kownkow Silo marow kowi takua talawm büah khai. <verse eid="JOS 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Amatni dow Gilead süng kowi kowh uowi mih Reuben hai Gad krungchakuüa maten, now Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa tut-e uamow Eleazar kowh chapa Finehas kowi kowchinah khai. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Amatni dow pakrung e lowk ia chi aluchow hamüt ia kowi Finehas kung krawi chin pe khai. Nami aluchowuüa dow Israel chen kowi kowh krungchak aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Amatni dow Gilead süng kowi kowh uowi mih Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten, now Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa tut-e kowkowiah now tek pe mih, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />“CHAKRAMANG kowh maru maten tek mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi naiawng enni tuk kingküaah khai? Tawngplawng kowchow ani aia tiama hownia enni tuk powt khai? Tawngplawng kowchow nakingküala aia kownkow kowmatia vüi enni tuk thawp phuchuara khai? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Peur hungh kowi kowh a-i changta mih angak e lai tak chekhai bow? Peur hungh kowi a-i changta angak mih rakowi CHAKRAMANG maru-uüa luk kowi makowng hawi uang ting khai. Kawmat pat paw nami angak <char style="w">ripra</char> dow a-i ka reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tiama hownia kawmat plan powt kown enni nau iawk mih bow? Ani CHAKRAMANG kowi che enni kingküa khai hanow tharau khe aia mih a-i Israeluüa maten luk kowi aia kowh kunmaraura nauang tüng kown. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Enni kaah mih pren che sürlawkma chekhai hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh taklowp taklangra te uowi mih anging pren kowi uang büah bowt. Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai phuchuara klen kowi kowmatia vüi hangkow thawp phuchuara büa diah. Naiawng che enni chang hanow CHAKRAMANG hai anging kowi enni kingküa mih chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Napiakta kownkow Thurai khowm bowkta mih uanh Zera kowh chapa Akan pawta rakowi a-i bowkbowk luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kunmarau mih enni tuk dowi bow? Aia kowh angak rakowi aia malowkchow kowng dowi mih enni tuk dowi bow?’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Nami laiklow ta hanow Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten, now Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa dow akeng mih Israel krungchak aluchowuüa kowi klangah mih, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“CHAKRAMANG lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai! CHAKRAMANG lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai! Aia dow tuk chekhai, now Israeluüa paw pacham tawi tuk lah. Mami che CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih hai chün lai dowi mih lup chekhai hanow ani mih kowngta anging taih. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Mami phuchuara dow tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai taking tasangra uanap anging changla kownkow nadowi, now CHAKRAMANG kowi anging powtta kownkow paw nadowi chekhai. Na khai hanow CHAKRAMANG matia pacham pe anging ripra lah.<verse eid="JOS 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />“Mami phuchuara anging thawp mih dow pur prakowi enni kowh krungchakuüa mih anging kowh krungchakuüa kowi maiawng natek pe pami anging kram rakowi chekhai. Nakhe amatni dow maiawng natek chepaw naia, ‘CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai hown tawng chow enni tatawng? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Aw Reuben krungchakuüa hai Gad krungchakuüa, a-i takra kowi CHAKRAMANG tow a-i mih pren sünghi dow Jawrdan aw chekhai. CHAKRAMANG luk kowi tawng alow paw enni kowh uowi dowi chekhai,’ napa büah kown. Naiawng hai enni kowh krungchakuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown nakramah kown mih saktuak anging kowh krungchakuüa kowi napiakta pe chepaw naia.<verse eid="JOS 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />“Naiawng rakowi anging tatek mih, ‘Chu, a-i thawp phuchuara lowk lah. Nachenganchepaw nami phuchuara dow tikah mih uanap hai akeng mih tawncher uanap a-i nachangla kown nadowi,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />Tikah mih uanap, akeng mih tawncher uanap hai taking tasangra uanap hown CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiia kown mih anging kowh paw alow uowi pami pacham tukla pakowh enni hai anging, now a-i kung kowi kowh uang ta uowi kown mih a-i kowh krungchakuüa vüi mami dow saksi chekhai. Nahanow pur prakowi enni kowh krungchakuüa mih anging kowh krungchakuüa kowi, ‘Enni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru nadowi,’ pami enni naia tek pe kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOS 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />“Anging kowi chepaw, anging kowh krungchakuüa kowi chepaw, ‘Enni dow Israel chen nadowi,’ pahai amatni che tek anging khai hanow amatni kowi maiawng anging natek pe kown, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara iawng thawpah mih mami phuchuara pra mü büa diah. Nami phuchuara dow tikah mih uanap hai akeng mih uanap chang müa kowi kowh a-i pipu-uüa thawpah mih nadowi chekhai. Nami dow anging paw enni iawng CHAKRAMANG kowh maru pami saksi chekhai,’ napape kown.<verse eid="JOS 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />“Tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai akeng mih tawncher uanap nachangla kownkow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai kowh taklowp taklangra te pur kowi kowh uowi mih phuchuara klen kowi akeng mih phuchuara anging lang thawp mih nadowi chekhai. Akeng phuchuara thawpra hownia CHAKRAMANG kowi nakingküala kown mih hai aia tiama hownia napowtla kown mih saktuak dow anging tut-e hang pacham uowi lah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Uamow Finehas hai Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa dow Reuben hai Gad krungchakuüa maten, now Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa tekah iawng sak-ih khai. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Now uamow Eleazar kowh chapa Finehas tek pe kowbüah mih, “A-i pungmadawng kowi CHAKRAMANG tawi uowila a-i reng pami ani dow anging tuk khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni thawp phuchuara mih dow enni kingküa CHAKRAMANG mih nadowi chekhai. CHAKRAMANG rut hownia Israeluüa kowi enni lawngah mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Nami kung kowi dow uamow Eleazar kowh chapa Finehas hai Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa mih nami hownia Kanan pren kowi uang plan büah khai. Now amatni dow Israeluüa kowi naiawngün laiklow maten uang lawp pe khai. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Nami laiklow tata now akeng mih Israeluüa mih lainowmma awmrawm khai, now amatni dow Thurai kowi kiow büah khai. Amatni dow Reuben krungchakuüa hai Gad krungchakuüa uowiah mih pren napiakta kown mih tek büah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Reuben krungchak hai Gad krungchakuüa tek mih, “Mami phuchuara dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai pami a-i bowkbowk vüi saksi chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami phuchuara ming dow “Saksi” pahai chap pe khai.<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Josua mala lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Aria aret kowi kowh ransu-uüa hown Israeluüa tasen rim mih akrama uang na khai bowt. Nami takra kowi Josua dow uang lawngtang mih nowm khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Akat khe Josua mih Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa, krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa, tara chet miuüa hai maru iukuüa maten kowi hawah khai. Now aia tek pe mih, “Ang dow lainowmma lawngtang khai bowt. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Mami pren kowi hawt iawng uowi miuüa kowi tawng chow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai changah mih enni khi bowk khowk chekhai. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih enni vüi dowk tasen khai. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Jawrdan aw hownia satkup pra kowh Mediteranean sata mowr ang powngta khowk mih pren hai kawmat kowh powngah dowi tak mih pren ün paw ang retla enni khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Ta lat mih chenchap maten kowi paw CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ngengche mih pren hownia nahenta enni kown taih. Amatni kowi dow enni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG naprütta kown, now aia kowh laikham iawng amatni kowh pren nape powng enni kown.<verse eid="JOS 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />“Naiawng rakowi Mosi rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih maten kaneuma chünah büa diah. Nami rirow hownia mapaw hang cham süt büa diah. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Enni tut-e kowh ta uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa hown hang taklawp taiua büa diah. Amatni kowh thuraiuüa ming khowm padow hang rük büah, now naiawngün thuraiuüa ming hown sawi paw hang kham büah. Naiawngün thuraiuüa pur kowi mih hang cham tabawk büah, now chup paw hang cham chup büa diah. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Kawmat mowr dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kaah sakowm iawng enni uowi khai. Nami iawng kawmat paw uowiah büah reng diah.<verse eid="JOS 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />“Aiuk aiukma mih hai akürma kangowh mih chenchapuüa kowi enni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG prütta enni khai. Ani mowr kowi miapaw nowng sen enni dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Enni kowh maru lowk ia sang 1,000 ia ransu kowi ia krawi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow aia kowh laikham iawng enni vüi dowk tasen khai. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi nasakrauah kown mih lawnguan kowi kaneuma towsak büa diah.<verse eid="JOS 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />“Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG kowi nuata hanow maiawngün chenchap hownia kowh ta plai miuüa hown che enni tawi tabawng khai, amatni hown che enni tachawng talang khai, now amatni hown che taklawp taiua khai hanow <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />maiawngün chenchapuüa kowi enni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai naprütta kown nadowi bowt pami sak kowi towah büa diah. Naprütta lak dow amatni kowi mih enni vüi powk iawng hai leng chak ia iawng aia nachangah kown. Amatni dow müa hown tep enni khe kowh iawng hai mikpüi uowi khe kowh iawng natowk enni ngare kown. Achur kowi dow mami pren klangiungma mih hownia enni nachum kown.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />“Ang dow nalüa kowng kown chowbowt. Mami laiklow klangiungma enni tuk chekhai: Nachang enni aiung kown pahai CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kham enni mih maten lowkchow paw chang enni dowi mih uowi dowi bowt. Aia kowh laikham maten dow uang tachih bowk khowk; lowkchow paw tachih dowi mih uowi dowk chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15-16" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe chün enni mih sangbowk laitawm che enni chün dowi, akeng thuraiuüa kowi che enni cham chup hai amatni pur kowi che cham tabawk khai hanow maiawng CHAKRAMANG nachang enni kown: Aia nachang enni aiung kownkow aia takhamta mih maten aia chang enni iawng dow aia nachang enni angak kown mih aia takhamta mih iawng aia nachang enni kown. Enni luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura nalün pluplup kown, now aia pe enni mih pren klangiungma mih hownia alenma enni napiak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 23:15-16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa plan tatow sangbowk laitawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Nami kung kowi dow Josua mih Israel krungchak maten kowi Sekem marow kowi arasang kuaah khai. Aia dow Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa, krungchak aluchowuüa, tara chet miuüa hai maru iukuüa kowi hawah khai. Nahanow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uang büah khai.<verse eid="JOS 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Nakhowk khe maru maten kowi Josua tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih maiawng: Achük alai kowh enni pipu-uüa dow Iufratis aw paipra pown kowi uowi khai, now amatni dow akeng thuraiuüa kowi chupiia büa khai. Abraham hai Nahawr iüah kowh pa Tera paw naiawng tawi chup khai. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Nachenganchepaw Abraham kowi dow Iufratis aw paipra pown hownia ang uang pawla khai, now aia kowi dow Kanan pren kowi kowh süng maten kowi ang pe krawi lenah khai. Aia kowi dow ang pe kaah Isak khai, now Isak hownia krungchak ahuma ang pe prungah khai. <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />Isak kowi dow Jakawb hai Esau iüah kowi ang pe kaah khai. Esau kowi dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Seir hungma mawngma süng ang peah khai. Nachenganchepaw Jakawb hai achapauüa dow Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="JOS 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />“Nami kung kowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi Aigupta pren kowi ang kowchinah khai. Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi dow kramra uowima mih ngare towk rah hown ang piakah khai. Naiawng hai Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni khai. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Now enni kowh pipu-uüa mih Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt hanow sata Rik re-e uang büah khai. Nakhowk khe Aigupta maru-uüa dow kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa hown uang kawikrawi enni khai. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kar se ang tut-e uang awr lü khowng khai. Nahanow amatni hai Aigupta siphaiuüa takra kowi dow aiiuma ang chang pe khai. Aigupta siphaiuüa kowi dow sata tui kowi ang pe tamirah khai. Aigupta siphaiuüa kowi tawng iawng chow ang changah mih enni matia kowteng khi khowk chekhai. Nami kung kowi khin krama süngrüp süngkangma kowi enni uowi khai.<verse eid="JOS 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />“Nami kung kowi dow Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh uowi mih Amawruüa pren kowi ang uang pawla enni khai. Nami khin khe Amawruüa dow enni hown uang dowk tasen khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow enni rut kowi ang apta enni khai. Enni pur kowi amatni kowi dow ang piakah khai, now amatni kowh pren dow enni powngta khai. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Nami kung kowi Zipawr kowh chapa mang Balak mih Israeluüa hown natasen kownkow kamrüt khai. Balak dow Moab pren mang chekhai. Now aia dow nape enni piati kownkow Beur kowh chapa Balam kowi uang hawla khai. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Nachenganchepaw Balam kowh laiklow ang nauta pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow piati takcha kowi pe enni prasi khai. Naiawng hai mang Balak rut hownia ang lawng enni khai.<verse eid="JOS 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />“Nami kung kowi dow Jawrdan aw enni uaipown now Jeriko marow kowi enni uang khai. Nami khin khe Jeriko marowchakuüa mih hawt dowk enni tasen khai. Nami klen kowi Amawruüa, Perizuüa, Kananuüa, Hituüa, Girgasuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa paw uang dowk enni tasen khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni bowkbowk kowi enni rut kowi ang apta enni khai. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Enni pur hownia Amawruüa mang pre ia kowi naprütta kownkow enni dowi rawn ang kowrik chin pe krawngkuai khai. Naiawng enni awng mih dow saidawng hai <char style="w">leba</char> hown enni senah kowh nadowi chekhai <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Enni kawmah dowi mih krawng bawn hai enni thawpah dowi mih marow ang pe enni khai. Naiawngün krawng bawn hai marow kowi dow kawmat enni uowi khai. Nami klen kowi enni ienah dowi mih grep hai enni chowkah dowi mih kanrawn uih paw kawmat enni ka cha khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mia iawng mih kowi chow enni nachup kown?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />Nami kung kowi Josua tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Kawmat CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kramah büa diah. Aia kowi dow kaah sakowmma hai anowmma chupiiaah büa diah. Iufratis aw paipra pown kowi hai Aigupta pren kowi uowi khe kowh enni pipu-uüa chupiiaah mih thuraiuüa kowi kuakta büa diah, now CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia büa diah. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia kown che enni nau dowi hanow mia kowi chow enni chupiia kown nau mih ani ruiah büa diah. Iufratis aw paipra pown kowi uowi khe kowh enni pipu-uüa chupah mih thuraiuüa kowi bow enni nachupiia kown? Nadowi now kawmat kowh enni uowiah mih pren kowi kowh Amawruüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi bow enni nachupiia kown? Tawkche ang hai ang kimchakuüa tarapdow CHAKRAMANG kowi chowtaih anging nachupiia kown” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowi powtta hanow akeng thuraiuüa kowi nacham chupiia kown mih saktuak anging hang pacham tuak lah. <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai matia dow a-i hai a-i kowh pipu-uüa kowi Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup changra hownia uang lawtla khai. Now aia dow a-i pur kowi awdara lup akraingma mih chang a-i khai. Aia dow patiama rawng a-i cham mang mih khin khe ün, now akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng iawng a-i cham mang mih khin khe ün lawng a-i khai. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Mami pren kowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa hai akeng chenchap maten kowi a-i pur hownia aia prütta khai. Naiawng rakowi anging paw CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiia kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow a-i kowh Thurai dow aia chowtaih chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Now maru kawmuüa kowi Josua tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh lup dow enni ia chang kown nadowi tham. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow chimsaima mih Thurai chekhai. Aia dow khowrbown dawma; aia klen kowi akeng chap kowi enni cham chup mih mapaw aia nau dowi chekhai. Enni kowh kingküara hai enni kowh angak dow aia nalawt enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Auown khe aia pe enni iungra chepaw enni che CHAKRAMANG kowi powtta kowh akeng mih thuraiuüa kowh lup enni cham chang khai hanow aia dow nakingküa enni kown. Now aia dow nauang pawla enni ngakra hanow napiakta enni kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa klangah mih, “Nadowi iow! CHAKRAMANG kowi chowtaih anging nachupiia kown,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JOS 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Now Josua tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiia kown pahai enni tekta khowk mih saksi dow enni matia chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa klangah mih, “Ow! Anging mih saksi chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Now Josua tek pe mih, “Naiawng chekhai hanow enni tut-e kowh uowi mih arup maten kawmat kuakta büa diah, now CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai prakowi kaneuma pe ching büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai lup chowtaih anging nachang kown, now aia kowh ana pek chowtaih anging nachün kown,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Naiawng rakowi Josua mih nami ni khe Sekem marow kowi Israeluüa hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. Aia dow amatni nachünah kown mih vüi ari arow hai ari aiang ün pe pe khai. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Akung kowi Josua mih naiawngün sangbowk laitawm laiklow maten Thurai kowh rirow bowih kowi ruiah khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow aiukma mih huaklu pawah lowk hanow Thurai chupiiara re-e sasua singh tut kowi chowkah khai. Nami dow amatni tatow sangbowk laitawm mih atungma natukla reng kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Nami kung kowi Josua tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Mami hua dow a-i lawnguan kowi saksi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG tek a-i mih laiklow maten mami hua tawi ta bowk khowk chekhai. Enni che enni kowh Thurai kowi kingküa khai hanow mami hua mih nathuak enni saksi kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Nami kung kowi dow Josua mih amatni bowkbowk kowi chowlowkkow uowi rah kowi chinta khai bowt.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josua hai Eleazar iüah kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Naiawngün phaw bowk mih kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Josua dow 110 ning singla now kowng khai bowt. Josua dow Nun kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Now Josua kowh uak dow maru kawmuüa mih Timnat-Sera marow kowi dupah khai. Nami marow dow aia kowh krawng bawn chekhai. Nami marow dow Efraim krungchakuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi Gas hungh tawngphak prakowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Josua sing uowi mowr dow Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia büah khai. Now Josua kowng kung kowi paw amatni kowh aluchowuüa sing uowi mowr dow maru kawmuüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia reng tak chekhai. Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow Israeluüa vüi CHAKRAMANG chang pe mih maten khi miuüa chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt khe Israeluüa uang pawla mih Josef kowh hut dow Sekem marow kowi dupah büah khai. Nami marow dow Hamawr krungchakuüa hownia tai 100 hown Jakawb ranah mih chekhai; Hamawr dow Sekem büah kowh pa chekhai. Nami marow dow Josef krungchakuüa kowh chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Nami kung kowi dow Arawn kowh chapa Eleazar mih kowng khai bowt, now aia kowi dow Gibeah marow kowi Israeluüa dupah khai. Nami marow dow Efraim krungchak kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi chekhai. Nami marow dow Eleazar sing uowi reng tak khe achapa Finehas kowi aia pela mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>